{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.791627+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5e3456ada699ea951f64ec8375fc22b11d00b36cf974d3b600db91fd8fb209a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 9 (Lower bound on balls) of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] Let
$B(\mu, \delta)$ be as in \eqref{definition boule BL de rayon delta en mu}
and let $B_{\mathsf{c}}(\mu, \delta) = B(\mu, \delta) \cap \mathcal{M}_{1,\mathsf{c}}(\mathbb{R})$,
\textit{c.f.} \eqref{definition espace probas contraint}. Then, for any $\mu \in \mathcal{M}_1(\mathbb{R})$, we have

\begin{align}

\liminf_{\delta \searrow 0} \liminf_{N \to +\infty} \frac{1}{N} \ln \overline{\Pi}_{N}[B(\mu,\delta)] \geq - I[\mu] \, .

\end{align}

Similarly, for any $\mu \in \mathcal{M}_{1,\mathsf{c}}(\mathbb{R})$, we have

\begin{align}
    \liminf_{\delta \searrow 0} \liminf_{N \to +\infty} \frac{1}{N} \ln \overline{\Pi}_{N,\mathsf{c}}[B_{\mathsf{c}}(\mu,\delta)] \geq - I[\mu] \, .
\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

