{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.668263+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b60bea292ff968914743b132fe520e0474b9a0ac71db1d58730975724844a270","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 (Negative drift of $X_n$) of arXiv:2607.20838, 'Long-memory Markov chains with power-law intensities'] Suppose that the model parameters satisfy 
