{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.245000+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b60c1207fc19433f8f9fae9f203833ce86c608ec80df304f8bb9260e95ab9862","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:varII of arXiv:2607.01463, 'Two Multi--Draw Coupon Collector models with different retention rules'] Consider Problem~II, where at each run the collector keeps the least--collected coupon. Then,
