{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.926880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6467f5cae556363127d19354ecf8928175046435d7bfc100ff19f65fdc438ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:tri of arXiv:2602.04673, 'Brownian paths as loop-decorated SLEs'] Let $\delta>0$ and let $\phi$ be a $\delta$-isomorphism from $\mathcal{L}$ to $\mathcal{L}'$. Then,
