{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:47:53.345762+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b67e544481014a80aacd42ad676a27dbd9834f5eaa10d2419f2409b2edde7b07","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2607.15125, '2607.15125'] The following estimate holds as $n$ goes to $\infty$:
