         \left\langle \cos ( \theta_x - \theta_y ) \right\rangle_{\Lambda, J/4}^{\mathrm{XY}} \leq \mathbb{E}_{\nu_{\Lambda , J}} \left[ \left\langle \cos ( \theta_x - \theta_y ) \right\rangle_{\Lambda, J, r}^{\mathrm{XY}} \right].
