{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.847055+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b744a9b185805f9e2267dc43aa60df408c83612c6ed28fd9fca326e27e894cc0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: limiting threshold of arXiv:2608.23756, 'Measure-valued fluid limits for partial service queues\\with correlated patience and servi'] For each $t \geq 0$, let
	\begin{equation*}
		\bar\boldsymbol{y}_*^-(t) \vcentcolon= \liminf_{N \to \infty} \bar\boldsymbol{y}_*^N(t) \quad \text{and} \quad \bar\boldsymbol{y}_*^+(t) \vcentcolon= \limsup_{N \to \infty} \bar\boldsymbol{y}_*^N(t).
