    \end{proof} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.555347+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b75bc16d8848e02594373572ced2b8884fd42ec8661c8bef57d130c2d5e27b81","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Dd-closure-prod of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] If $g$ and $h$ are strictly positive $MTP_{2}$
