{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:45.548919+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b76c95b6770828548d7a399a0437d39b0b1ba15e72b4b4c265ee57bab53d503f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem volsi of arXiv:2411.17023, 'On the first hitting time of a high-dimensional orthant'] Define for $d \in \mathbb{N}^*$ and $a \in [0,1]$
