{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.347663+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b79e983df437e7efdf77a5c57f93d83a52a724543bd2808ecf4a8cd5e8b7be53","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:sharp-alpha-min of arXiv:2412.01489, 'One- and two-particle spectral gap identities for the symmetric inclusion process and rela'] For all graphs $G=(V,(c_{xy})_{x,y\in V})$ and site weights $\alpha=(\alpha_x)_{x\in V}$, we have
