{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.236439+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b7ad134b4d3f5d6485e037e6485eef0e2bd04c43f10b36e896e771f3dc058589","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:finite-time-w2-stability of arXiv:2607.00149, '\bf Uniform-in-time Propagation-of-Chaos for\\ Stein Variational Gradient Descent'] Under Assumption~(ass:Wass of the paper), let $(\mu_t)_{0\le t\le T}$ and $(\nu_t)_{0\le t\le T}$ be two (weak) solutions of~(equation eq:mf-svgd of the paper). 
