{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:48:17.121050+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b816a3a5ca4ed329d2dd65c6c774ccad39d1bfa31caeec382be349bc40c2cbff","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.27222, '2605.27222'] Let $\alpha\in(0,\pi)$. Then for almost every $\theta\in(-\pi,\pi)$,
