    \end{equation*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.747384+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b834a1d2cbd6e5b55d1c931539a71abfa7f799e7fedb707c67fefcf1b7f174c3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 4 of arXiv:2607.28865, 'First-Passage Percolation on Spread-out line graphs: Microscopic Regime'] Let $a>0$ be a fixed constant satisfying Assumption \textnormal{B.\ref{ass:B1}}.
