{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.706801+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b89926834f44ac5845e16636e439ca643fe1ed29ca35a77977f7ec006e551055","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:concentration of arXiv:2412.00279, 'Optimal local storage policy based on stochastic intensities and its large scale behavior'] Assume the above quantile is exact, in the sense that $E[U_{\theta_C}(0)] = C$. Take $C=cN$ with $0< c \leqslant 1$. Then for any $\varepsilon>0$:
