{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.585872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8ca6dc6066368e0badab6faee93a40056497a81cb6349ef1b9aafacff8aa018","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma W1.1-1L of arXiv:2411.09949, '$W_{\bf d}$-convergence rate of EM schemes for invariant measures of supercritical stable '] Under $(\mathbf{H}^\gamma)$ and (equation Dis of the paper), for any $m\in(0,\alpha)$,
