{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.146758+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8e641b01893f8505e8df4997604a6bb4d4d76fe6f94cb95e44dab65cc491280","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 of arXiv:2604.13149, 'The Distributional Tail of Worst--Case Quickselect'] For every \(t>0\),
