{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.131337+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8e9f99833242a9845aa397eb798711eecedf26248c23835a0ac5bcd96be1810","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th3 of arXiv:2510.10898, 'A central limit theorem for unbalanced step-reinforced random walks'] Assume that
