{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:04:59.425944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b95a64ab08bafa96048bcb78f00a7a1828019ef9e92b26f770d1a9becbf66f14","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Concentration_Inequality of arXiv:2605.18744, 'Lattice random-field Widom--Rowlinson models'] There exist constants $c,C>0$ such that for all $n\in \mathbb{N}$ the following is true. 
