{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.776812+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9b9d73ee9b2564cbccb4b9eb9a66536e7a5023ba85881e6002a3661ce9128ea","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma thm:ldsde-comparison of arXiv:2411.01364, 'Global Dynamics of Granular Media Equations via Stochastic Order'] Suppose Assumption (asp:potential of the paper) holds. Let $\mu,\nu\in C([s,\8);\mathcal P_2(\mathbb R))$ and $T>0$.
