{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.991170+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9f1807c826b119f35e5365d18967fa65c17386bc281dd1561a2ed84b7b28d61","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 105 (cf.\ {\cite[Theorem 2.5) of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] {Mak24}}] 
