		\end{equation}
	\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.242167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba2bc8e8459dab60895feeb9a4a85d92ce533c10d8613f6eb16ebc5870faf1f2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 18 of arXiv:2603.05174, 'Regularization of the superposition principle: Potential theory meets Fokker-Planck equati'] Let $V$ be such that
