{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.722592+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba450563b3baf98ffc364c57dfe0b9cff940036b0b9f127cccbd4ab5b8064266","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2606.01944, 'Propagation of Chaos for Mean-field Mean Reflected Backward Stochastic Differential Equati'] For any $1\leq i\leq N$, set 
