{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.807811+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba7e072fb54b2a399d6c6e210d0c24cdc06738b424fddcec9f9dc80e4c2c7bea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2608.30570, '2608.30570'] On a translating soliton $\Sigma$ in ${\mathbb R}^4$, we have for any $J\in {\mathcal J}$
