& \quad + B^2 r^2 + n^{1/2} B r^{3/2} + n^{1/2} (B + B^{1/2}) r + n^{1/3} (B^{4/3} + B^{2/3}) r^{4/3} + \log n + r^2 (\log n)^3 \Big] ,
