{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.712839+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb1f6660c032b474cad9618185bedbd58bf530eea10bfc908b5c2247ba0aa83b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 36 (Dyadic Volterra estimate) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $a,b\in\mathfrak C$ with $a\ne b$, $Q\le c_{\mathrm{ap}}N$, and $0<s<1-2\beta_b$.
