{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:48:24.615250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb23888ea9b9526f18061851b103357b5c221f9efe33b3d4d9f8d3b644c963d0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:tv-ber-lb of arXiv:2601.04079, 'TV homogenization inequalities'] For $\textup{{\bf p}},\textup{{\bf q}}\in[0,1]^n$,
let $I=\left\{ i\in[n]:p_i\ge q_i \right\}$ and $J=[n]\setminus I$,
with
