{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:24:20.956184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb4fab9c33729578a63309f835fc3783a22b0479d0f28aedbfcbc2a4ae650200","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:Fnk-Mnk of arXiv:2508.12464, 'On the Fitness Landscape in the $\NK$ Model'] For any $\alpha\in (0,1],$ we have that 
