{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:59.403927+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb56873cd3d9795c55228bb1ab494842d08965a1257ce9cdb916b6e0ca38e728","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2609.03976, '2609.03976'] The Fischer pairing has the following properties.

