{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.593378+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb6d31075d42c098e8f38be7adb4203da409cca57907f98b1dd85ab5cf71cf7d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Exact $\MAX_5$ identity) of arXiv:2608.25221, 'Representing MAX functions using two-hidden-layer ReLU networks'] We have the following identity.

