{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:13:22.532503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bba3f946645ed6b2ab192979d48460c86e5ec00cf4d60b11acdcdfc24eb3d8c4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq.defGk_star of arXiv:2506.07158, 'The diffusivity of supercritical Bernoulli percolation is infinitely differentiable'] For every $k \in \mathbb{N}_+$, we define the set of robust good cubes  $\mathcal{G}_{k}^*$
