{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.519743+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bba707ed885293e43f0ac9c821237a79bcbd607a7de796e6b4d2047ff15013b6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:linear_giant_11 of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{prop:biskup}
