{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.642896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bbad54722fb96e51ac8c11248a6f034ad78d551ed9049a9327804ba4b467809f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary c4.10 of arXiv:2603.14447, '\Large \bf Backward doubly stochastic differential equations with and without reflection u'] \sl
