{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.353535+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bbb9157c65cffa210f767eedb3f8ce810a3b3f3e46f685702a14f079ad97064e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 ({\cite[Theorem 3.4, 3.5) of arXiv:2606.17501, 'Critical spectral behavior and large deviations for geometric $\alpha$-stable processes'] {SikicSongVondracek2006}}]

