{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.652746+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bbedb7a683a7a62957a0d9f48ceca591d8d63bf411e6aa1cecc244f57c3893db","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma deteministic of arXiv:2411.04590, 'Singular stochastic delay equations driven by fractional Brownian motion: Dynamics, longti'] Consider the equation (equation linear delay of the paper) and recall the definition of $\Delta$ from (equation characteristic of the paper). Set
