{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.812283+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc084a4711a808e04f607baa8d1c0756722a0493ae367da3e2e7267d345d7658","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:dov-holder-general of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] {dov}}]
    For all $L\geqslant 1$ and $\epsilon\in(0,1)$,
