{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.403435+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc20af87c14e40dc53521ec5e232932ee78d6c01a2e922fa505d8382fa5f3385","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2608.31070, 'Sub-Laplacians on Compact Lie Groups: Heat Kernels, Distance, and Zeta Determinants'] Assume that $\pLie$ is bracket generating. Then, for every $g\in G$ and $t>0$,
		\[
