{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.433621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc61663a57154c6cbc912c7952bfd85a61a601dcb7523a71d0d923d215ae7c12","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:elementary-jensens of arXiv:2508.05802, 'Localization of One-Dimensional Random Band Matrices'] For any $p,\delta\in [0,1]$
