{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.693933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc64204055f3e11cde39443cb50f51e7cdb5268a779ff8f1dc29df0d85f679d1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 35 (One-dimensional block integral) of arXiv:2607.26377, '\textbf{Entire Logarithmic Signatures\\ of Bounded-Variation Paths in Finite Dimensions}'] Let $x:[0,T]\to\R$ be continuous and of bounded variation, and let $0\leq a<b\leq T$.
