{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.288032+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc64215d24163e7396c43c24eeb6c18493f92f8904fe113101a4cd09200d3029","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem IntegralFinite of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] Let $m\in \mathbb{N}$, $a,b \in \mathbb{R}_+$ such that $a+(m-1)b/2>1$ and $ma>1$. Then,
