{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.920252+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc687ba7b07b88a5582bde4a3a5679d33f7dcdbf584434898b993b6d5416e409","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2601.21762, 'Navier-Stokes with a fractional transport noise as a limit of multi-scale dynamics'] [FVroughpaths]
