{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.626403+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc8b8e11255f0c6e229420881bc1aa4ac92c10d3288696c8ac11f9259a01f74f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor P-U-T-U of arXiv:2609.01300, 'Virasoro Constraints for Orbifold Curves'] The following commutators hold:
