{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.815261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bce8692ceb56f7a518c690ec797fab2b276efc083e24083d058534edb4427b28","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm t:2main of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] For $\varepsilon>0$, let $S=S(\varepsilon,\beta_2)$ be the strip defined in (equation e:strip-unscaled of the paper).
