{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:10.022119+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bcf0c2ab1b677b8e07c5c50d573bb40363de1260e01d7d0115fce345b7976610","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 68 of arXiv:2602.14618, 'Finitary coding and Gaussian concentration\\ for random fields'] Let $Y = (Y_n)_{n \in \Z}$ be a renewal process with $\gcd\{k\ge1:f_k>0\}=1$ (non-lattice inter-arrival distribution). The following are pairwise equivalent:
