{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.812158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd6bbce5973e6b3fb6ac4fca748f2fa92102ceb4b9c3747b0a3a79894115098a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:dov-pointwise of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] {dov}}] 
    For all $L\geqslant 1$, there exists a random constant $\mathfrak{C}_{(p:dov-pointwise of the paper)}>0$ 
    such that the following is true.
