{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.167315+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd94b36728779057f457c51ef8d64c257596cf37898841bd32889bfaff6fe7ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2604.17973, 'Schauder estimates and classical solutions of the Dirichlet problem for stochastic parabol'] Let $\alpha\in(0,1)$ and $\gamma\ge 2$. Suppose that $u$ is a quasi-classical solution of \eqref{eq:model-half-space}--\eqref{eq:model-half-space-bc} such that
