{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:23:58.618792+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd94f217119bc47174aa77e6dde00f45e8804f11860c20c6091adc1c85a30818","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 163 (Differential and integral identities involving $\doublenulltoritwoarg{\ubar}{u}$) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Let $f$ be a scalar function,
