{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.345462+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd94f4a6ac94905dcc9f94950b99bff24336269e51181129f04cbe354b6afe44","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:hill-potential of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] For $f \in \mathcal{D}_{+}^{2}$, the \emph{rank Hill potential} of $f$
