\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.574003+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bdda800139921c085a90bc9246b46c337cde0993e27e6632574967846278839d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 44 (Initial estimate) of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~\ref{thm:opt_ll}, let $E_*$ be a regular right edge in the sense of Definition~\ref{def:reg_r_edge}. Uniformly for $|E-E_*|\leq\eps_*$ and $\eps_*\leq\eta\leq1$,
