{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:56:11.132583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be26675b3e61439cb6b73451904f35243dc42ba566a483b22e98f6f24eaecc51","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 25 of arXiv:2608.10183, '2608.10183'] Suppose that
