{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.271999+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be267892680a0032277b3987fa487b4ee637d21b5e64b4f07d3619f61f9621c6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2606.21111, 'On Elephant Random Walk with Delayed Amnesia'] Let $\{M_n, \mathcal{F}_n\}_{n\ge1}$ be a locally square-integrable martingale in
