{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.693378+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be2fbfe47dad1e8f5c9ba427819e2d8bb2bb1a5953f5f43a0b842f9ddfc4e384","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor corSmallCTnm of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Fix  $b>0$ satisfying $ b^2 < W(2/e)$. If  $m = (1+o(1)) \frac{b}{2} n^{3/2}$, then
