{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.016282+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be345490a768cabbf4149540e71f7475a6978e346d895ddf736dea84e06c5628","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:weighted_entropy_tail of arXiv:2605.15401, 'Noise Tradeoffs, Stationary Information Flow, and Structural Balance in Unit-Birth Network'] Let $\pi$ be a probability distribution on $S=\mathbb{Z}_{\ge0}^N$ with full support satisfying
