{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.685539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be51fe32a37f0e84a8cc24e48e3da3d2401d9b85205346799efd6e6f8d4d1801","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:irreps of arXiv:2609.01920, 'Isospectral and not strongly isospectral spherical space forms with non-cyclic fundamental'] Let $\Gamma_d(m,n,r)$ be a Type~I group with generators $A$, $B$ satisfying 
