{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.755948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be75d22cb7c7f8605a148f12be1a41a966b754e221b2e1239b04ba1eaac8106f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn unitaryweingarten of arXiv:2412.00593, 'A new approach to strong convergence II.\\The classical ensembles'] For any $L\in \mathbb{N}$ and $\alpha\in\mathrm{S}_L$
