{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.619038+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be7933b05c45208c0ca2f49181c342ef2144031b0bc8035efad4db31bb719b97","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 10 of arXiv:2506.09637, 'Nonlinear Stochastic Filtering with Volterra Gaussian Noises'] Let $\boldsymbol \zeta \in  \Omega G_{p}([0, T], \mathcal V)$, partition $[0, T]$ as follows:
