{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.867143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be96784bbd72b91f586dd88d444a946b5f12ab4019545c9af224b49d8e225fb3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2608.29501, 'Disorder Thresholds and Free Energy of Brownian Directed Polymers with\\ Product and Radia'] There is \(C<\infty\) such that, for \(a,b>0\) and
