{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.042480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be9d7d5238780c360be3b5cf6ef9d648a1272e2cf2ca0ff358821a38751686df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2609.00757, 'Improved bounds in Birch's theorem for forms in many variables'] Let \(I\) be a translate of a box of side length \(H_1\) contained in \(|\h|\ll H_1B^\eps\), let \(\alpha\in\RR\), and let \(q\leq B^2\) be a positive integer.
