{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:37:28.985439+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bef6026943ad0c126a5d42336bbc4fc4c890a8452a586e154c91ceb00ba35cd5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary lim int M_eta ... of arXiv:2412.00865, 'On the spectral problem and fractional diffusion limit for Fokker-Planck with(-out) drift '] Let $M_{\lambda,\eta}$ be the solution to equation (equation eq de M_eta + cont. of the paper). Then, for all $\lambda \in \mathbb{C}$ such that, $|\lambda| \leqslant \lambda_0$ with $\lambda_0$ small enough, the following limit holds:
