{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.288153+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf093504b55f3a118aaac6f7ac337e374ad04826082668ce474778a9e3a66328","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop mmX^ of arXiv:2411.01849, 'A tamed-adaptive Milstein scheme for stochastic differential equations with low regularity'] For any  $ l_0 \geq 2$,  and $k 
