{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.924887+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf681e1e4a83c895cacd1639c1fc040d8f1d381b63bb181712e5a5a4c022cc97","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem general-ThmB of arXiv:2601.21762, 'Navier-Stokes with a fractional transport noise as a limit of multi-scale dynamics'] Consider the setting of Lemma~(le:uniform-estimate of the paper).
     Then the  following statements hold.
