{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:37:28.987638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf9b3d92ea6d050e98947109b12c78f502250067c95ca6dbe2fd160de44337cf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:moment-MKT of arXiv:2412.01015, 'Classical beta ensembles and related eigenvalues processes at high temperature and the Mar'] The moment relation~(equation moment-relation of the paper) is equivalent to the following  recurrence relation
