{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.953975+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf9b4e229b7286ef5b5a2674598c839f040a36d5807a2b5d0f1e77609fbfca3b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2606.25494, 'A functional central limit theorem for kernel gradient flow and infinitesimal gradient boo'] ~
