{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.160210+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf9b95aea6eeae44e3fe04b6410696df19b8236bf40a974c4812cb61413df69c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm Thom-marvelous-appendix of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $G$ be a compact Lie group. 
