{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.592163+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c010fe727d7ee9dbfcb5e8674de202813f0b08622390bd1799bedd3a27ab405d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma 2-KMTrate of arXiv:2412.08932, 'Gaussian heat kernel asymptotics for conditioned random walks'] \ \\ 
