{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.626169+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c05fe5ff51587de4e296c31e5431ba3091f8333d6395fbae1d32da6b3f33d97a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:est for G-SDE of arXiv:2411.03512, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of Sublinear Expectation System and Applications'] Suppose Assumption (Assumption G-SDE of the paper) holds. Then we have the following results:
        \begin{itemize}
