{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.823679+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0a383c97e04ee0df79a04db507b6fee9b17a200dacfd59ee97dcedbe40dd255","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 25 of arXiv:2608.13208, 'Universality in dimension $1$ of kinetically constrained lattice gases'] For every $\omega\in\Omega_{0}$, the path given in Definition \ref{def:path}
