	where ${\rm gap}_{\rm RW}(G,\alpha,\omega)$ is defined in (equation eq:gap-rw-abs of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.007329+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0b02001e0939f7624eece52b336990b5009d0c924ead4cf97a0a125ba30e643","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2609.02801, 'Ratio and limiting zero distribution asymptotics for symmetric multiple orthogonal polynom'] Let \(\Phi(z,t)\) is the solution  of  \eqref{eq:ratio} such that $z^r\Phi(z,t) \to 1$ as $z \to \infty$. 
