\end{equation}
where $\det \nabla\phi_{t,z}^{-1}$ is the Jacobian determinant of $\phi_{t,z}^{-1}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:32.010479+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0dd5573c1402690abe56de6709cd6d970ee5613a130c00b9da4992997be9594","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2512.02855, 'Loewner--Kufarev entropy and large deviations of the Hastings--Levitov model'] Let $\rho \in \mathcal{N}$. Then
