{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:19:00.882302+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0e0f966ef69a184565c00aabf2f16d6a9ab55633a8c40cccb20ffb097bf2095","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 44 (One-step Bernstein bound) of arXiv:2608.20337, 'Information on trajectories:\\ martingales and random times'] Let $X$ satisfy $\E[X\mid\cG] = 0$ and $X \leq b$ a.s.  Then for every $0 \leq \lambda < 3/b$,
