{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.083924+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0f47a7c02210f6ce273afc14ccdafef8ec7cbd215da61e7a5f7677df00914ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem limCor of arXiv:2504.18739, 'discrete analogues of second-order Riesz transforms'] \begin{enumerate}[label=(\roman*), leftmargin=*]
