where $\mathbf{u} = (u_{0}, u_{1}, u_{2}) \in \mathbb{F}_{0}^{1}L^{\Phi}=  W^{1}_{0}L^{\Phi}_{D_{x}}(Q; I_{nv}^{\Phi}(\Omega))\times L^{\Phi}(Q; W^{1}_{\#}L^{\Phi}(\Omega))\times L^{\Phi}(Q\times\Omega; W^{1}_{\#}\mathcal{X}^{\Phi}_{A})$ 
