{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.220001+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c100ec3b38ce5872c4daaebcfda41946cc2c7560f11f7de42de753720015d44e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Explicit first obstruction) of arXiv:2607.17630, 'Higher-Order Hankel Obstructions to Free Infinite Divisibility\ for Beta Distributions'] Let $p,q>0$, put $s=p+q$, and set
