{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.340304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c103ac2b559ee4d85082761f9887af511f6f3a2b9efb07a1ce448aff5ab52e54","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2512.07202, 'Hitting Probabilities for Hypoelliptic Differential Equations Driven by Fractional Brownia'] Consider an RDE 
