{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:43:04.564051+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c13701aace43188019732f45f9c0c737d9580282bff3ba3e175597bd73e25b7f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 of arXiv:2605.16868, '\ttl'] The infinite-dimensional fluid model is defined as follows: 
