for all $0<\delta<1$, $\lambda>0$, density $f$ with respect to $\nu^N$
and $N> 4\ell$. In this formula, $s_d(\ell)$ is the sequence
introduced in (equation 2-18 of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

