{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.371247+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c17d980a97f662e53cd773e1015e6c26ebc1d0d2133df80c9edd0600829539ff","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:wellposed of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] Let $w \in \mathcal{W}$ and $f \in \mathcal{D}$. Then:
			(i) $\rho_{w}[f] \in \mathcal{D}$;
