{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:56.348379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1e9f4fb22cd18be259309eba6cb33d86c7c59b5968bb9d7fd48b0407da684e5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 16 of arXiv:2603.13798, 'Iterated Graph Systems (I): random walks and diffusion limits'] Fix $r_*>1$.
