{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.800422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1fbc53669ef15e09d96be06556e76332e527ed38dd197931bbc1f07fc9c9234","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:cr-moment-intro of arXiv:2510.05850, 'Three-point connectivity constant for $q$-state Potts spin clusters'] Consider the continuum fuzzy Potts model with $q \in (1,4)$, $\kappa = 4\arccos(-\sqrt{q}/2)/\pi \in (8/3,4)$, and $r = 1/q$. 

