{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:27.584578+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c280be48318dfd0cfe95806055c975f812b9cb8bfef4099be7f39d83f4392adf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 of arXiv:2603.00353, 'Aldous-type Spectral Gaps in Unitary Groups'] For every $k,d\in\Z_{\ge1}$, 
