\item for $g\geq3$, the intersection of $\mathscr S_g$ with the Ekedahl--Oort stratum attached to $w\in\SAdm(\mu)$ such that $\supp_\sigma(w)=\tS$ and $w$ is of positive Coxeter type;
\item for $g\geq4$, the locus in $\mathscr S_g$ where the $a$-number is at least $2$.
