{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.093630+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c28835c6da6e4f2b2a566bcb00cd45ca6d064c1add1f757be3eb881c430719a4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:Lie-weighted-formula of arXiv:2609.02710, 'Asymptotic Mean Value Laplacian\\ on equiregular sub-Riemannian manifolds'] Let $W\in C^\infty(G)$ and $\mu_W=e^W\mu$, where $\mu$ is left Haar
