{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.866232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2a9128c2c550acb3ffdc406f5286f55bd900a3882c4032827b49b380ff47913","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm expl_asymptotics of arXiv:2411.00629, '\Large Transformation of Stochastic Recursions and Critical Phenomena in the Analysis of t'] Let $\alpha>1$.  Then as $t\to\infty$, 

