{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.655542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2fda1d2d4532182c8f863eb1c3ba289a7eebf3d7bf4e8a6bfc3e9d2d8a96130","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2609.03726, 'Inverse Scattering for Single Photons in Quantum Optics'] Let $n \geq 2$ and $\delta>\frac{1}{2}$. Then there exists $C_{\delta}>0$
