\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.339375+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c325a75bed2f0928c244ae17d23283b769732cd0dc641da4e7b8371da66609ac","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2506.15044, '2506.15044'] The following assertions are equivalent:
