{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.253531+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3697483316b75b35628aaea47c213b4a461ded14cb3a8f1452f29d8ec2b8f1f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Suppose that $(F_n,R_n,\mu_n)\in \bbF_c^{\circ}$ converges to $(F,R,\mu)\in\bbF_c^{\circ}$
