{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.769264+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3a1f8a6bc96602fcf44f3187a1b7b1db2af5699f268162d74a7189f4b30c39d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem cA7 of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$,
