{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.635360+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3cec82d28560009a3a85c75e00b99b73ed9f61e9c7c53a91ed23c8c9dae832e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2605.31088, 'On couplings for kinetic Langevin diffusions'] Let $(Z_k,\tilde Z_k)_{k\in \N}$ be given by the iterated one-shot coupling defined in Section~\ref{sssec: iterated one-shot} applied to the Markov chains~\eqref{eq: linear Markov chain}. Then for all $k\in \N$ we have
