{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.812909+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3d5e1e883d2bcc0728f467576ff465cb27e500627600bfee174b00e956db199","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2608.30570, '2608.30570'] Let $\Omega$ be a bounded domain on $\Sigma$ with smooth boundary such that the isoperimetric inequality
