{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.555514+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3dd5c199740b69b380c4b616e46ba8a0c80fce6bab94df0c0aa564fdff0c5f4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.26038, 'Rotated semicircle laws for permanental roots of Gaussian random matrices'] There is a constant \(C>0\), independent of \(N\), such that
