{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.943960+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c447e6e94371ac15d05c8c3f063d2edb6bcd7066afafffadeb8466eda6af31f0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 15 of arXiv:2608.26259, 'Cutoff with an $O(1)$ window for Potts Glauber Dynamics\\on lattice at High Temperature'] There exists \(C_{\mathrm F}<\infty\) such that, for every admissible profile \(\vs\) and every \(x\in\mathbb Z^d\),
\begin{equation}
\Phi_\vs(x)
