{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:56.741171+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c457a38a18fd4505f19afc7add31cd79026920c6e77ac616726368af6e95cfbb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-stat-meas-RWRE-homo of arXiv:2507.19222, 'Convergence of the KMP model to the KPZ equation'] The stationary measure of the Beta-RWRE on the finite segment $\{0,1,\ldots,N\}$ is given by 
