{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.737475+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c469a62bbda04fe2a41d44f89889b326a155aeac502333ed24f4865285c53700","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2608.30089, 'On the Coefficients of Hurwitz-Type Matrix Polynomials'] The $q\times q$ matrix polynomial $\f_n$ in (\ref{hup01}) is called
