  -\frac{V(x)L\left(  \frac{x}{\sigma \sqrt{n}} \right) }{\sigma \sqrt{n}}  \int_{0}^{u}  \ell_H \left( \frac{x}{\sigma \sqrt{n}}, y   \right)  dy  \Bigg| 
