{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.163466+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4d390e3192e9a3889c0fcd3e3da1eda1306b7a0175f525b7bc8cdec4c64ddd4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2607.02489, '2607.02489'] Let $\fS\in\upGamma_0(\HS)$ be such that $\Argmin\fS\neq\emp$, let
