$\RP$-valued random variables, and let $x_0\in
L^2(\upOmega,\FE,\PP;\HS)$. Iterate
\begin{equation}

\begin{array}{l}
\textup{for}\;\nS=0,1,\ldots\\
\left\lfloor
\begin{array}{l}
x_{\nS+1}\underset{\mu_{\nS},\rho_{\nS}}
{\overset{\FE_{\nS}}{\approx}}
