{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.215037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c502ee33bac2d80b49ce8364ebdb15dff6cb09fd754407f9ca7764a763f5718c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma delta 1 of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] Let
