{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.067214+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c50637e500279fa13950ae45fce032392621e900ac49af051a00d5121107b9ab","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:link_fep_ssep of arXiv:2412.04032, 'Cutoff for the mixing time of the Facilitated Exclusion Process'] For all $s, P \ge 1$,
