{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.950535+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c519d7ad9885cd5deac82e8e7861f5cce6d00790836751eecba20e54b856fe47","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Maintheorem 1 of arXiv:2608.02956, '\AMMDisplayTitle'] Under the model above, the joint distribution of \(B\) and \(G\) depends on \(k_1,\ldots,k_n\) only through \(k\). Define
