{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.747657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c58f4abe90f22f1ae5c401ac40730b3ec5ab3047163ded5dfab3495afa2d8ead","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:gaussian of arXiv:2608.28169, 'characteristic polynomial of self-normalized random matrices'] Assume $X_{11} \in {\mathrm{DAN}}$. For integers $k_1,\ldots, k_\ell\geqslant 1$, we then have the convergence of traces
    \begin{equation}
