{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.849138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5bde4069b828662d95a35f61c69b698f98e71ddd6a38bf1cf46cc8392b4a1e5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2511.10814, '\Large \bf \boldmath\ \\ Convergence of the extended Kalman filter with small and state-de'] Let $(M(t),\covm(t))_{t \geq 0}$ be an EKF satisfying assumptions (A\ref{cond1})-{(A\ref{cond4})} of Theorem \ref{CvgTH}. Suppose also that { $ \qcovm= \eps^{-1} \covm$ }		satisfies 
