{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.486473+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5bdeedaef960865a2e55e138be179f4192c57eff5ed28a0fec15e312e693224","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 80 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] If $n$ is odd, then a.s. the generalized function $\psi^{\rm gen}_{n,m}$
