{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.496004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5c42ec16151c5984d2a2205ce7d5074906774da95e60113470b448244a11d2a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma ratio-limit of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let $P_{n}\Rightarrow P$ be a sequence of probability
measures on $[0,1]^{2}$ with common marginals, and suppose $
