{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.796323+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5dbce6cb34c26457ecf7e3b62038e1f474b52ad7b348b0af1bc09f3eca26425","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma hardtwoedge of arXiv:2509.23496, 'Crossing probabilities in geometric inhomogeneous random graphs'] The two-edge crossing probabilities satisfy
