{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:52:32.334587+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c61922a804e8da5c89682b714b1d22d5d293ffc7c7b6c52cf3294fd2ed18eb3e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:interfacextension of arXiv:2609.03980, 'Decay Rates and Domain Dependence of a Coupled Wave-Heat System with Spatially Dependant H'] Let $p:\mathbb{R} \to [0,1]$ be a weight function, 
