{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.574371+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c62eddfbd85c98398483057dbb92fc06fd9604a4d55a944022f2a0c14ad10384","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma sec:estimates of arXiv:2605.15742, 'Turbulent stretching of FENE dumbbell polymer model via special stochastic scaling and sin'] The solution $f_m$ of (equation approx-linear*SDE of the paper) satisfies
