{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.481833+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6322bf4532ebeab5795ae522047db9c7e1170f5b315179b6782466549b08ac4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 22 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] For $n = 2k+1$ odd, a.s. $\psi_{n,A}$ is a generalized function with
