{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.479428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6341da2770770e54e58a2bb2acf62788f2c5697e5cce4bc54b1b399308f4c9c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 29 of arXiv:2608.28355, 'About the contractibility of the walking coinductive equivalence'] The suspension-hom adjunction from \cref{IteratedSuspensionAdjunctionMarked} forms a Quillen adjunction
