{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.524381+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c63ee308a10740d6fde8c6ef65b686f7df7289e18ab2f1d9f05e9c5f8d8e2249","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma orbit of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let $T^{\ast }$ be a cluster inverse. Then $T^{\ast }$ has a
