{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.439316+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c63fbf66c9e413d57f496101724e5a2464fbc977178046d043b15458265fa4c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:myopic of arXiv:2608.24087, 'Knowing When to Ask for Help: Bayesian Self-Escalation in Hierarchical LLM Agents'] Under the ``finish locally'' comparison, escalate at step $t$ iff $B_t<\tau_t^{\mathrm{myo}}$,
