{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.225074+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c65d03fb1d204d15fa55e5db4deae189795b1d955ca1485e4501e2fbc186c855","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 22 of arXiv:2607.17943, 'Coadjoint averaging and cross-scale fluxes in a fast-slow stochastic Euler-Arnold system o'] Under the same assumptions of \emph{Lemma \ref{Lm:AverageSlowGeneratorOtherTermsjForQuadraticObservableQ}}, we have
