{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.855104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c67686db52e8b8fd0ea12ab4fd0e0d9a39c77eb062f1578b4eff33359c88ee72","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2608.21014, 'The stochastic Cahn--Hilliard equation in critical spaces'] Let $1<q<\infty$ and let $(e_k)_{k\geq 1}$ be an orthonormal basis of
