{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.714203+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6895c19d934687dd27be1d30c6be8f4349c90cc4dd9dfaa6711daa101d4b6e8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:infvolRGmap of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] [FSmap]

