{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.496651+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c697c6686866bd5af591c4d8e82943f5f27b8115349bd18f6d9f915aa8707f0d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma unimodal-subseq of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let $L^{\ast }$ and $T^{\ast }=(L^{\ast })^{-1}$ be
