{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.793826+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c69c9cf4f045827d2d1b6389f6a1dffe0319474393a9d120e61c4ac2563be823","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma bound the intensities of arXiv:2411.09260, 'The Hydrodynamic Limit of Hawkes Processes on Adaptive Stochastic Networks'] There exists a constant $c_T$ (the constant is independent of $n$ and $j$) such that for all $t\leq T$, all $j\in I_n$,
