{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.595007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c69d09346dc748d199899263d6adf89b6f746764351350e2cca6eee58197880a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn of arXiv:2411.09988, 'A Study in Markov Chains, Loop-Erased Random Walk and Loop Soups'] Write a path $\omega$ of length $n$ as a finite sequence of points
