{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.847139+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6ae93b41d2fa74ea9929b9b2857dd7b25c2889d3070c212080d44572570555c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: limits of integrals involving r of arXiv:2608.23756, 'Measure-valued fluid limits for partial service queues\\with correlated patience and servi'] The following property holds in the set $\Gamma$ of probability one:
