{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.793111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6cde1b338c0e2b342dd1abff983d10ab2444f44638b92b9e310a247d58eddd7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop BoundsCorGFF of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] Let $G^{D}$ indicate the Green function of $D$. Then, there exist finite constants $k < K$, that uniformly on $x,y\in D$ and $0<\varepsilon, \delta<1$
