{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.778059+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6e692c84328de1ca406e8a7245f7fdb5fc5253d529712b634b640642f594996","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2609.02225, '\textbf{The direct moving plane method for weak solutions of the fractional $p$-Laplacian}'] There exists \(b_*>0\), independent of \(\lambda\) and \(\varepsilon\), such that
\begin{equation}
