{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.929918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c7b55c3517a456d9b0d2dbc7e4ef52033275631e02f56253d88d3bfdd55cf611","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2505.21774, 'The friendship paradox for trees'] {\bf [Correlations of vertex types for infinite trees]}

\begin{itemize}
