		\begin{equation}
			\E_\alpha\left[\mathcal{N}([1,\infty))^{q}\right]
			\leq (Cq)^{2aq} B_{\max}^{2q}.
		\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.134643+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c81be4a418ff7e501464440fba56b3ac62bf9b5c491c59a0586d03f1dc4cf94d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 29 (Empirical scattering intensity) of arXiv:2608.22342, 'Completely Positive Entropy and Fourier Central Limit Theorems for Stationary Random Measu'] Under the hypotheses of Corollary~\ref{cor:point-process-fourier-clt}, for
