{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.759232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c851b2d00f6644a843fe89f7e8a240ce33bb6d7aabadcfa7aa4808ba30fed452","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 59 of arXiv:2511.20322, 'Dissertation'] Assume \assref{assum:H} and \assref{assum:bD}.
