{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.679374+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c857ba9dafe92300ac33f96c6074d666cf2844ba5b5823cc503e164ff61ea51b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:compact:supp:sink of arXiv:2412.09235, 'A semiconcavity approach to stability of entropic plans and exponential convergence of Sin'] Assume that $\rho$ has compact support and that $\nu$ satisfies (eq:TI of the paper).
