{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:37:28.983004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c85d6db348faaf55b4b257de11d0f0ea878d8d9115c410b4eb7d421e5dfe8504","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 1.1-CP of arXiv:2412.00708, 'Stochastic PDE approach to fluctuating interfaces'] For some $C, c>0$, we have
