{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.777186+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c89f3fbedb4aa6c9fe8eaad56294ea99a55b0af8c2b0ef9f045d1c13f08ae26d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 (Explicit expression of Hermite polynomials) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] For any $n\in\N_0$, one has 
