{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:15:08.998852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c8c9dffe698feb577e3f31215aa96fcadb73a7753587a108de46cc5f80f9c7d6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition defn:wr of arXiv:2411.10829, 'Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble and its Laplace transform'] For $\vec r\in\mathscr B$, we define its weight $w(\vec r)$ to be the constant $P(Q_m)$ in the corresponding term in expansion.
