{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.419517+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c8ca1b78d7416e501c1e9d56025c38ff7fc669c2e88fbebd15cd6da50316aaea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 25 of arXiv:2605.16560, 'Seasonal Statistics of Shannon Rate in a Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Cellular Network'] The coverage probability with respect to Palm probability distribution of typical time and typical max-signal in the tropical case are given by 
