{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.353393+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9516c8a201e84d776ffdc4c99791ce702c945f51985c15054fc8df845609e14","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L4 of arXiv:2608.22945, 'A Momentum-Based Variance-Reduced Algorithm for Federated Multiobjective Optimization'] Suppose that Assumptions (A1 of the paper)--(A2 of the paper) hold. If $\eta L K \leq 1$ and $24e^2(\eta L)^4K^4+24\eta^2L^2K\leq \frac{1}{2}$, then
