{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:14.891097+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c951be91480d93d2f12b821bc9cad836a021cc50c40a747604b71a7a6d386511","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.11608, '2607.11608'] Let  $\mu$ as in \eqref{mu_def}.  Then, for every $K\in \R$ and $\eps>0$,
