{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:45.027596+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c95d8a77759476610e0a3e52a83eb9f88542bbf5817d5fdf42b33496fd1c51b5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2606.06859, 'The rectangular finite free heat flow'] The equations (\ref{eq:ode}) are equivalent to the vector equality
