  \item[$(3)$] $(\tau_n,X^{(n)})$ is an FCS for $X\in \mathcal{D}^\mathbb{B}$ (resp. a CS for $X$), where $\tau_n=T_n\wedge S_n$ for each $n\in \mathbf{N}^+$.
