{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.565510+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9ea63cd2e6ea89902210fc3c153027c45dde6d6de1e10fc3c1583465c2d1521","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:disjoint_connections of arXiv:2508.18807, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation I: High effective dimension}'] Consider Bernoulli bond percolation on a weighted graph $G=(V,E,J)$ with some $\beta\geq 0$. The estimate
