{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:27:32.472279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9fef731c7e458bd898e928793d0be094ee1350938ce80cba574e183acc08ebc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop unique of arXiv:2509.26254, '$K$-Branching Random Walk with Noisy Selection: \\ \Large Large Population Limits and Phas'] There is a  unique traveling wave solution $(G,\nu)$, which is given by
