{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.624889+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca59818b3ab0e75b134deee65cf69f08d8e507b0cae47a812da7a9e1d301fd21","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:Cnk-intro of arXiv:2412.05503, 'Critical scaling profile for trees and connected subgraphs \\ on the complete graph'] Let $n \ge 3$ and $N = \binom n 2$.
