{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.421331+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca8282264425a918c9ffc5145d6d5caae0b6e5a98b6c0c6f226ee03849408424","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2606.09121, 'Truncated Signature Information for Mixed Fractional Brownian Paths'] For $Z_{t,h}^\theta=(u,Y_u)$,
