{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.975184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca83ad5e82cc25e9e4612ccdcc88cb2632090fd282bfced17cb7ff30dbd5e3c1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:boundA of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] For any partition $\rho\in\mathcal{P}([2])$, we introduce the short-hand notation $${\tt I}(\rho)\eqdef \begin{cases}  
