{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:14.576305+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_caf766fb9f441d24ec0b1c6068435668dcc011a996a7512f25030aaa17d7f126","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2607.11076, 'Smoluchowski-Kramers Approximation for Stochastic Differential Equations driven by Fractio'] \cite[Remark 5]{alos2003stochastic}
