{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.581243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_caf81a2f6e2a78f72aa6fb4ac6f62148fa025a7cf61a5e8ca86c4dbeeb717e83","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 8 of arXiv:2606.14917, 'The Ornstein--Uhlenbeck process on $\scr P_2$ \\with a volatility operator'] There exists a family of Hilbert spaces ${(H_\mu)}_{\mu\in \P_2}$ such that:
