{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.991984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cbb6250caf7014f5a0b8c31ac36f2caa287dc34dc14a1b14af2e34c351f347de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2604.01257, '2604.01257'] Let conditions $[{f}_{\nu}]$, $[{\mathcal{L}}_{\nu}]$ and $[{\omega}_{\nu}]$ be satisfied. Then
