{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:02:11.344462+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cbf0873239f64bb7f74c5db175913feb962c9d63b78279d2152ff5f682c530dd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem-cut-equiv of arXiv:2510.26123, 'Directed distances in bipolar-oriented triangulations:\\ exact exponents and scaling limit'] For $n\in \mathbbm N_0$, let $\widehat\lambda^-_n$ be the initial vertex of $\widehat\lambda_n$. The following are equivalent. 
