{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:51:11.953960+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cbf7d9dd9b3be275b597c021b41d188bd48116e549b3f3aac1ccde612ff54d58","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (Uniform bounded four-moment surrogate) of arXiv:2608.07820, 'Linear Spectral Statistics for Entrywise-Transformed Spiked Wigner Matrices under Shifted '] Assume W3 and W5.  After decreasing \(\delta_0\) as in
