{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:32:56.077392+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cc121987001e64bb4f4035c995591ba722c8e81a9f3f685d599fc3d16d63cac4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:Fourier-MLF of arXiv:2411.12192, 'Sample path properties and small ball probabilities for stochastic fractional diffusion eq'] (Mittag–Leffler Fourier transform). Assume  $x>0$.
