{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.074950+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cc12b47f8b164d3eb54a87a8cc65439e37c29c60a34a3b9026b79b1e6530b847","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Balan-Conus 2016 of arXiv:2504.14457, 'Abstract'] We have
