{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.395204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ccde75986a4a30b88977b0a3d0d2389a31a0ef7086998dcee1ca7774099f807a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:aux of arXiv:2507.19554, 'Full extremal process in four-dimensional membrane model'] Let $A \subset [0, 1]^4$ be non-empty and open. Let $z_i$ be such that we have $\max_{x\in V_{N}^{K, \delta, i}}h_x^f = h_{z_i}$ 
