 	\!\!\!&\!\!\!& + C \cdot \sup_{t\in[0,T]}\mathbf{E}\Big[\big|X(t)\big|\Big]\cdot \int_0^T ds \int_0^\infty\big|g(s,y)\big|^{2p} \mu(dy) .
 	\end{eqnarray} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.066162+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd082097c67997134da31d75c41784d9e1cb9488239243e8058ec0582aed3550","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem prop:instest of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] For every $\mathsf{q} \in \mathsf{R}_1\cup \cdots \cup \mathsf{R}_7$, define the constants 
