{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.479921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd4167c8d3ed8cb7628311f2187cfd93f6f0074d7d110e61696960c4ae436beb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 79 of arXiv:2603.05174, 'Regularization of the superposition principle: Potential theory meets Fokker-Planck equati'] Let $K$ be a bounded kernel on $(E, \cb)$.

