{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.638694+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cdc47ebe004fcc9cb1f66dcdafd329bdc0803fb64c804dab5769ef853866893e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 ({Nakano and Takei \cite[Lemma 3.1) of arXiv:2605.23461, 'An almost sure invariance principle for the Takagi--van der Waerden class functions'] {NakanoTakeiTakagifunctions}}]
