{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:06.978771+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce1cb04d9f402d251ef4e07facf73b4c5abc264fd1f7332f350c27cdb016805e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:scaling-form of arXiv:2607.26169, 'Scaling and partial universality of the height zero probability in the 2D Abelian sandpile'] Let $\mathcal{G}$ satisfy Assumption (a:graph of the paper).  
