{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.057553+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce5ab76d4d02ef5df60f87abefb11dbcbd426acff571674b4e6a12a4ad67b375","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2607.14332, '\textbf{ Dimers, filters, and $q$-deformed real numbers}'] Define Dijkstra's function ${\rm fusc}(\cdot)$ by 
