{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.675098+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce9de979cb3736ec1ee2222cd043c939af119662e20576ac5e2d9621f23d5765","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma det-martingale-limit of arXiv:2605.28194, 'Delayed Blow-up in 3D Fluids via Pseudo-Transport Noise'] For every $\varphi\in C^\infty(\mathbb{T}^d)$, write 
