{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.052613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce9f1afd4dcfe25a2be8d67f0ce07ac00540f7e3ffa9ec2b0907226964990412","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:delta of arXiv:2608.30888, 'Three-term asymptotics for discrete\\ Hardy--Rellich constants in high dimension'] For every fixed $\ell\geq1$,
