{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.944661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cea240c72b8e61f1879098b53e781934b46345842309f0a2c6f6a8c12ff53d05","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm geo-tri-equiv of arXiv:2412.05746, 'Hyperbolicity, slimness, and minsize, on average'] Given a geodesic space $(X,d)$ or a graph $G = (V,E)$,
