{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.152337+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cea2e24cfc38cb861308a5251f6e92b28543a5191fe0a36127785b4927b523f1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:localtimeboundaryball of arXiv:2510.13733, 'Internal Diffusion Limited Aggregation \\ with Critical Branching Random Walks'] Let $d \geq 3$. 
