{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.109632+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ceaa8b2066aea4fc3be35a3cf0b2a71b1b2d4620ec6a62c9520c8ee6252b22e4","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition px of arXiv:2411.15881, 'Stable Approximation for Call Function Via Stein's method'] If $X$ has a distribution function of the form
