where  $\rho_{t}(\cdot)$ is the unique weak solution of (equation PDEproblem of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:50:36.768411+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cedb20eb309e04eea0be0aff1ccb9673988070a9b325e1152db94551ff0b05e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2609.04155, 'The subconvexity problem for symmetric square\\ $L$-functions in Level aspect'] We have,
