    for all $t \geq 0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.386096+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf0d237f01043f1d26762aba869ba4af205e5c030af0f5b50c93b065c2b21133","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Pro eq:A of arXiv:2411.02141, '\bf Uniqueness of Maximum Scores in Countable-Outcome Round-Robin Tournaments'] Assuming Model $M_{[0,\,1]}$ and $n\geq 3$, we have
\begin{align*}
&
