{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.332815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfc3f75958ff34ac9c7ca6f08a3aa055f7128306bd968601bf17ecbd3a3ccdef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2506.22085, '2506.22085'] Let $\theta$ be the involution on $C([0,T];\bb T^d)$ defined by
