{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.192276+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfccaf441dca0394055729231f7de40d92cf537462ce6b9d92516b383c595b53","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 12 (Bounding  star discrepancy discrepancy by $L^1$-Wasserstein distance) of arXiv:2605.03528, '\bf Kolmogorov-Smirnov distance and discrepancies {\em versus} Wasserstein distances'] Let $\nu $ be an absolutely  continuous distribution on $\R^d$
