{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.652537+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfe6b330cdefd76d52d448fa47659742d1136ac886e33cfe57bb90b5a0c38e42","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 34 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] The following assertions hold.
