{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.142344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cffeb35e9e762d9757992db9a95524cccd1b4bea5996d270498dd961240c46ad","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2604.05910, '\textbf{Well-posedness and Hurst parameter estimation for fluid equations driven by fracti'] There exists a constant $C=C\left( t\right) $ independent of $n$ and $H$ such
