{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.681056+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d064761d2d42a011463c739c925a0a241e05fb07bbdcc69d4b5c87e668665f43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2607.26223, 'The pair correlation function of the $\Sine_{6}$ process'] Fix $n\in \Z_+$, and 
