{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.659379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d0e4d808c7ca95b668ef47c82a75f5216b6f434b93feff6e64e4049c342d0350","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm exact_Wa of arXiv:2604.07183, 'Stopping on the last success with unknown odds: asymptotic minimax optimality of the plug-'] Let~$a\in(0,1)$ and~$n\ge2$ be such that~$1\le t_a\le n-1$, and let~$\ell_j$ be as in~((eq:La_def of the paper)). Then, for any~$p\in(0,1)$,
