Consequently, for \(Q\succeq0\) and \(x\geq0\),
\begin{equation}
 e^{x\mathcal B_Q}(P_0)=\Gamma_{\wedge}(xQ),
 \qquad
 \operatorname{Tr}_{\mathcal F_{\wedge}(H)}\Gamma_{\wedge}(xQ)
