{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.335506+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d1535f412a21c3703011536a35d089a5a8bd860cfc3fcfc90f9ac59b1f0e1fe7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2511.06414, 'Non-uniform Edgeworth expansions for weakly dependent random variables and their applicati'] There are polynomials $\bar H_j$ whose coefficients are rational functions of  $p_k$ and $q_k$ for $k\leq 3j$ so that with 
