\end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.180377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d16a2439113e9cbb26311d563b7a226d30a2287173d37f1955cc07cb13900a26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop main of arXiv:2606.24793, '\LARGE Random sequential nearest-neighbor coloring on trees'] Recall the definition of the events $\mathcal{A}_i$ given in (equation eq:defai of the paper).
