{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:04.170196+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d180926c29569e356df8ef4fb5f3eca3ed718722d64bed489ba36833e49a9ae2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:proper-reference of arXiv:2609.00399, 'Shannon's problem on the monotonicity of entropy and a Conjecture of Tao'] Fix $1\leq K<\infty$.  There are constants
