{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:09.015759+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d18d7490ee5eb5da122f567d4ec8e1f1e80b4e184620ab6d1049c0fff54b37b0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:base_difference of arXiv:2609.01697, 'Unique ergodicity of projective cocycles over the 2D stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] Let $w^1, w^2 \in C([0,T]; \mathcal{H}) \cap L^2([0,T]; H^1)$ be such that $\tilde w \overset{\mathrm{\scriptscriptstyle def}}{=}
