{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.873972+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d1dba30e09e60ea88e375309a8ea343fd05a9065f4587f34bbaa899f167ef9ae","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainthm real BKK of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] Let $\mathcal{E}$ be given by (eq: def expsum in intro of the paper). Then we have:
