{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.325205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d1e138aaa839d11db1421eba6c50a4b0ee21eedd18a50843b721e549ce4dbacd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:two-cut-kernel of arXiv:2609.03532, 'Airy limit for the Jack process and topological expansion'] Uniformly in $L\ge 0$ and $\delta\in\mathbb Z$,
