{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.138225+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d1ea0b3961eb7fc74277113d5ad88f438419303d9b73f919ec8848985a4c0d41","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.27569, 'Laplace and Dolbeault operators on Sasakian manifolds'] The formal adjoint $\delta ^{c}=\left( d^{c}\right) ^{\ast }:\Omega
