{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:45.024020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d22fbd945e97400f725df1f7d99330791dac12583ceaaebeccae21f965ef8b50","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2606.06489, 'The Missing Central Limit Theorems for Local Functionals of Berry's Random Wave Model'] As $R\to \infty$, uniformly in $a,b\in S^1$,
