{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:30:14.226193+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d28ee65f14166c76f2ff5148ee576a2446c52fd34545c0c86fc6e891b04576f3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem decomposition A-nu, B-nu, C-nu of arXiv:2608.23156, 'Disc counting statistics of the real Ginibre ensemble'] Under the assumptions of Lemma~(lem: generating func cN counting statistics of the paper), for every positive integer $\nu$, we have
