{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:31:02.812293+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2d07825a6dc6e17f2aad649ef67a3c9b27b6a0ee3711ad53514943edba4c8c7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop cA of arXiv:2609.01501, 'Singularities of star cluster algebras'] Let the situation be as in Def.~(Def:cA of the paper).
