{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.505947+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d325ab5e138faf19636e1a6cb47e7b33e526dfc14571d4b73e4b567af5c1b21b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 103 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] \cite[Thm. 2.4]{Tappe}
