{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.587095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3518efb5d483727e1e915d508c83c7c721206cc671ef57e20e4602a92b75789","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem nu-1-lem of arXiv:2608.30518, 'Grow-up rates of inhomogeneous semilinear heat equations in the critical dimension'] It follows that $\nu_1\in C^1(T_{0},\infty)$,
