{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:58.361965+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d35221f0b177df2f7def72cfcdb7696c0026522a4179411b0f6ddd473769287d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2506.19064, 'Variational formula for the logarithmic potential of free additive convolutions'] For any compactly supported probability measure $\mu$ on $\mathbb{R}$,



