{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.612355+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d352be54e2903a3c97bba9fe3d5b5cf3c729cc6582a6b553431b4574c3d553f9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 38 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Assume $a_n\ge 10/\beta+8$ and $2a_n/n\le \eps_n\le 1$. Then we have
