{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.579498+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d356d2b0900cd4acbef30367b7b0b73fb8c0e72152b4ef3c17090e865939d40d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 37 of arXiv:2608.27372, 'Universality and sharp thresholds for ellipsoid fitting'] Assume the hypotheses of
