{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.789702+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d385e8557234b8288f538284fd2a8e46e0b6e08fca9f929369160ba83e784e36","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition LAST of arXiv:2411.18374, 'Drawdowns of diffusions'] For $\delta>\rho$
\begin{align}

&{\bf P}_0\left( T^+_\rho>\delta\,|\, M_{\theta_\rho}=y\right)=
 \frac{S(y)-S(y-\rho)}{S(y)-S(y-\delta)},
