{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.364281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d417790a5a1457eb99de720083d931e9b929c9024de3d609f0c05edcd6e79ee3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:centear of arXiv:2606.02472, 'Correlated uniform attachment trees'] If $T$ is a $(K,\delta,c_1)$-good tree on $\{0,\ldots, n\}$ with centrality sets denoted by $A_r$, $r=1,\ldots, n$, then
