\end{equation*}
\end{itemize}
Then
\[
\Pr\!\left(
\min_{S\in\mathcal M_n,\;S\neq S^*}\mathrm{DCIC}(S)>\mathrm{DCIC}(S^*)
\right)\to 1
\qquad \text{as } n\to\infty.
\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.483142+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d4399d244deaca09969333fcd138ba5dd9739ef3c0cfe36a073ccf2e52b4f615","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2605.28377, 'Geometric functionals of Brownian motion on Hermitian symmetric spaces of non-compact type'] For every $t > 0$, $\alpha > 0$ and $\tau \in \bar{\mathcal{C}}$,
