{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.006959+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d480d00a42935d0fd78ca444e4d5dd62f8cf17d5ca755b91ca5421255ef3cff0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2609.02801, 'Ratio and limiting zero distribution asymptotics for symmetric multiple orthogonal polynom'] Suppose $(a_n)_{n\geq 0}$ is a positive sequence for which
