{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.348399+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d486acab32025fe1e9c015f0ef0f13ef36c8b7db796f636299c7604f25a45907","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conj 4 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] Let $H$ be a fixed 
