{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.984580+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d48752909c4cefaaa0be0165ec5bd42f069822e5f624fd3405c2d61b51b50c99","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 43 of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] For a vertex set $A\subset V_n$ we define the minimal subtree of $\cT=\cT_{n,\beta}^\omega$ containing all vertices in $A$ as
