{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.026978+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d493eaaa2b29f5745fb197c89096662e1497110e71d0fac220f289ad76ad42c5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop 2.3 of arXiv:2607.28167, 'Temporal properties of the stochastic fractional heat equation with rough dependence in sp'] ([HHLNT2017])
