{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.058589+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5719b3474806d4dde798c71536d7a7b873d64229d497dfb19b8ab0f915402db","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2607.14332, '\textbf{ Dimers, filters, and $q$-deformed real numbers}'] For all $n>0$,
