{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.719246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5739603beed91d80c63bb45ff4db1a19c2d116b406d704f2a5fe11f10bafb44","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.01166, 'Nonparametric inference for density-dependent McKean--Vlasov diffusions'] For any candidates $\xi,\zeta\in\cX_m$, the truncated invariant densities satisfy
