{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.693040+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5ebca83099651713cba656e99e59a29da48dcde93851199d8bb119f318a0f5f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thr thrUniqLineSchw of arXiv:2607.29423, 'Schwarzian Field Theory at High Temperatures'] Let $\mathcal{P}$ be a Borel measure on $C^1_{0,+}(\mathbb{R})$. 
