{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.775190+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5fcf1068cf2ce73147e2aa5dddad02e69a615c4fa34d6ed5a6fcf2d2b5fd09b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: infinite_l_activation_time of arXiv:2608.00399, 'The Heavy-tailed Frog Model'] Let $\lambda>0$, $d \ge 2$, and $\alpha > 0$.
