{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:25:35.781429+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d61e8b92c4e98d58346c13aa93ab43a436b483379992e9387fbfd5d91bbeeb54","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.less_peaked_coupling of arXiv:2603.11043, 'An asymptotically optimal bound for the concentration function of a sum of independent int'] Let $\mu$ and $\mu'$ be probability measures with rational probabilities
