{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.902905+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d705e1f89d75e9563acad3ffc9b8ca8db56b5e2f770e6b4d45524a7bfd92d7b2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma 3.3, Yao, Chen, and Guo~\cite{YCG11} of arXiv:2608.25065, 'Detection of first homology via random geometric graphs in the thermodynamic regime'] \label[lemma]{Yao o close in infinite comp}
