{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.931061+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d70fb6d6aafe42881ac94f8fac24aa49af0afde629b71293d3e0017af2f0c6e1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 11 of arXiv:2506.19123, 'The longest increasing subsequence of Brownian separable permutons'] For all $n \geq 1$, set $r(n)\coloneqq \Pp{|T|=n}$. Then
