{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.345110+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7256e7005048e2828db1c4b8462589360c9035d85117ae5a7f38e0a2770efb2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:invariant of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] The Cauchy family is exactly invariant under the flow:
