{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:44.403035+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d72bfcd7a8ad8f9a26d8022cb6ba0072cd099d00716318ef64db19ef8548c44f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2609.02842, 'Global Well-posedness and Asymptotic Analysis of a Damped Nonlinear Wave Equation with a C'] For the values of $p$ given in \eqref{values of p}, the mapping $\N:D(\A)\times L^2(\varOmega)\to L^2(\varOmega)$
