{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.760870+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d72cef7e0f641f3bfa560afad1f968213d82f21e1b965c2aaeecf6d0405b30ef","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def-u-m of arXiv:2604.24914, 'SPDEs with time-independent\\ L\'evy colored noise'] {\rm The process $\{u(t,x);t\geq 0,x\in \mathbb{R}^d\}$ with $\mathbb{E}|u(t,x)|^2<\infty$ for all $(t,x) \in \mathbb{R}_{+} \times \mathbb{R}^d$ and the Poisson-chaos expansion:
