{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:53:51.330324+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d74142a7baadfef169487f15e833b95e0f7397f960f17f0b282f3ca654ca10f3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:rho of arXiv:2605.03703, 'Scaling Limits of Bivariate Nearly-Unstable Hawkes Processes and Applications to Rough Vol'] In the zero-start scaling regime, the functional correlation
