{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:25:44.994489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d77836d92ada21d21bff0d160c2d9f36c53f9c6f03eac4ab3690b69acbb5180d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.11801, 'A non-local singular non-linear Fokker-Planck PDE'] Let $\g\in(0,1)$ and Assumptions \ref{ass:K} and \ref{ass:F} hold. Let also $f,g\in \shc^\gamma\cap L^1$. Then we have 
