{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.789735+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7bbf9b860370df6740f49cb19d431cbacd2ba783fb3fdc23ee74fa203ea461a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Teo T: LBBPT of arXiv:2606.10165, 'The frog model with death and drift on free products of complete graphs'] In the symmetric case, 
