{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.157730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7bc9d0301143f6ee080bf6554be933f446d8f762535b4a5269157d4985126ee","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 (Arbitrary-order quasineutral expansion) of arXiv:2609.01589, 'Uniform stability of expanding simple waves for Euler--Poisson--Boltzmann: a singular comp'] Under the hypotheses of \cref{thm:main}, assume
