{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.871650+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7ce899f11e3762d1a0e166af1908a759e5d8f8091d1e9b8958d05619561922e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 23 of arXiv:2608.29148, '2608.29148'] On $\{\wt \rho<0\}\subset \wt{\mathcal{G}}$, we have
