\nabla'_a F_{bc}=-\frac{4}{\wt\rho}\wt\nabla_A \wt F_{BC}-\frac{16}{\wt\rho^{\,2}}\wt g_{A[B}\wt K_{C]}-\frac{16}{\wt\rho^{\,3}}E_A\wt K_{[B}E_{C]}.
