{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.813099+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7eab5fe251dda71bfaba0b3356494504a3ee234a9b23ae7d8eec749e5ab238a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:stopped_Holder_continuity of arXiv:2411.09482, 'Anomalous Regularization in Kazantsev-Kraichnan Model'] Fix $\gamma \in \left(0, \frac 12\right)$, $p\ge1$. Then, for every $R>0$ it holds
