{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.543348+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8311dbadb5b55197086b22ee0e34b413c9bdab63cf011d799ac471361fa11e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma G_at_q0 of arXiv:2603.27906, 'Marked GUE-corners process in doubly periodic dimer models'] The function 
