{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.871230+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d832f84eb411e2ffdb8a0e9a80388cb7c2b5f3e684fdf25344542557bf1139b4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 (Schatten link theorem) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] For $1\le r<\infty$, the link product restricts to a contractive bilinear
