{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.872735+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d852e223192db20c74e2b632b9b5a7cca44b15eba8c4f0472a46c8de83cb0eb8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 31 (Analytic contraction product) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] Let $B,C\ge0$.  Then
