{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.776602+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d854f812f2c1d32f78c4907630a1ae163305ba8d1bd3de2d150cf6dc54cb964a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 1 of arXiv:2603.25459, 'Cram\'{e}r-type moderate deviation for double index permutation statistics'] By a suitable normalization, the general DIPS (\ref{general_DIPS}) can be converted into one of the following forms
