{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.752394+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d86593b93e17f025de9b22e66126e8f60c01b5c0803794dab4fce9bfc8441187","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2608.30155, 'Gradient Estimates Near the Natural Exponent for Very Weak Solutions to $A_p$-Weighted Qua'] Assume \eqref{struc}, \eqref{unidegen} and $\omega \in A_{p}$ with $p>1$. Then for any
