{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.887139+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d867a2a1a8e466d3022c3b93ddf7b4e425907beb08391d86a4cb361671ea5084","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 27 of arXiv:2607.17030, 'Stationary measures for log-gamma polymer on a strip and in half-space'] Fix $\alpha>0$ and $u>-\alpha$. 
