{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.962476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d87c2495122a3de9ece25a1064e315611916c3395653d58dbdb5febf6ae8a9ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 of arXiv:2608.12291, 'When should one stop the most exciting game?\\ {\tiny Sequential Inference for win-marting'] The second spatial derivative of the value function admits the representation
