{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.758252+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d88481fabcd3cbde9a7d16986bdefc23f7ae6d97639d67cc5491a4a3f90bb51f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2604.11921, 'Replica symmetry up to the de Almeida--Thouless line in the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model'] \label[proposition]{prop:Doob}
