{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.266215+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d89b7b408ca1b57ee6c569ae255478eb269a8a6c0d81329f96c4986ff7654f5f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6 ({Gronwall type lemma}) of arXiv:2604.20323, '2604.20323'] Let $f:[0,T]\to\R_+$ be bounded and such that for $h=T/N$ with $N\in\N$,
