o_m(1),

\end{align}
\rytodo{where the big-O notation omits a constant depending only on xxx},
both $(\bar\rho_t^\mu)_{t\in[0, 1]}$and  $(\bar\rho_t^\nu)_{t\in[0, 1]}$ are piecewise $\W_2$-geodesics determined by the marginals at the time points $t_j$'s with $j=0, 1, .., m$,  and
