{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.360902+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8d4df1e4382c449b0366a2a58ea4d0f714fa559306cb13fc6adc1b76b1fd473","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 24 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] Fix a $\widehat{\bb X}_p(\cdot)-$equivalence class
