{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.139671+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8d53a777efe21d8564e54cf5c9f6d2881ce879775fb50cb28f0b21b17267003","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma prop:CNfailB2new of arXiv:2510.12365, 'Planted clique recovery in \\ random geometric graphs'] In $G_k(n,r)$, if $\mu\ll n$ and $k \ll n/\mu$, then     
\begin{equation}
