{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.292816+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d9316faf1da963ee85d77343b4bc2d63fdce5ab9a731a58e8d804e7eb368cfcc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm persistence of arXiv:2411.05235, 'A comparative study of three mathematical approaches applied to the reversal of AMR'] If \( \mathcal{K}_{0}^{s} > 1 \) 
