{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.836509+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d95632549c4f9f63248de2f3973ee07ac098a4d77c7458f27f08a68ad3e2ee30","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2511.09726, 'The non-covered set in Dvoretzky covering is a set of multiplicity'] Suppose that the sequence $(\ell_n)$ satisfies the assumptions \eqref{A}, \eqref{B} and there exists an integer $d\geq1$ such that 
