as equation in $H^{-2}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:13:21.347009+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d9c1ace424ec20c42c11084ca3276797cbcaeaf105b6e0ddab492b325378c903","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 of arXiv:2609.01559, 'Erlang Loss Model with Energy Constrained Servers'] Let $\alpha = \frac{\rho_Q}{\rho}$, then the mean and covariance of $Q$ and $C$ are given by
