{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.831424+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d9e2d75ab98218c9b017d5f8426261fdc4994297f071034ab269032d32615070","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:lower_bounds of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] For any relative deviation $\delta \in (0, 1)$ and corresponding absolute deviation $\varepsilon = \rho\delta \in (0, \rho)$:
