{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.295217+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da1efa63f922f987ea2d44213216e35e2380e7aba27743e50cae9b7fa7c4e366","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:gamma2-kernel of arXiv:2602.19192, 'Bakry--\'Emery Curvature of the Fractional Laplacian\\ via Fractional Brownian Covariance'] For $\gamma \in (0,2)$ and $\xi,\eta \in \mathbb{R}$:
