{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.054977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da78729f4a930e2e34bbde6028404337044c60c46c585145c68fbc5a3c5bbb7f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:projected-background of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] We have
