{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:50:30.569968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc0f513785beb6f4e48a64da5743b66ff8c071f2ea55f4d86026b24ae2eedd1d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Chow--Rashevskii theorem for translations) of arXiv:2605.30869, 'Approximate Transitivity of Young Translation on Rough Paths'] Let \( \mathcal{H} \) be a Hilbert space of \( \mathbb{R}^{d} \)-valued paths such that $
