{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.038507+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc894041d13943318859dac5ac61d92b6a3f805827cce5de7edef8dc7d4bde4f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:3.2-F of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] There exists a finite constant $C_0$ such that
