{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.484503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dca2a78d0d6fcdc30b387b2742ae40d5497fb8fa8105bbf8957957e0d70419f7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:evaluation:bias of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] Let
  $\mathrm{bias}_{\nu} =
    \E{\widehat{\mathrm{BER}^*_{\nu}}} - \mathrm{BER}^*_{\nu}$
