{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.595819+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd1ae9e2e5adcceb37bb7280489545db0bb612598ba6005457105bc490f53ac1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Binomial resolvents) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:binomial-resolvents}
