{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.157793+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd63588a622fd9974557e677bc9d0f6819016fc1bf99bd02a84e9cc5703474ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2607.02272, 'The case of equality in BK'] Let \(p\) belong to  \(]0,1[\), and 
