{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:49.837176+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dda1ea15c3c0b605373817097bf97448b4f83b66a7158875540904f06a2cc20e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2506.13571, '2506.13571'] Let $F\in \mathbb{D}^{1,2}(K)$ be such that $\E\big[ \| DF \|^4_{\fH\otimes K} \big] <\infty$
