{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:49.203731+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dda967e177a7184a451776ccda3c25b41a2ae363bc4a8b1ccc1639592a363127","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2604.26898, '\bf Stochastic Scaling Limits and Synchronization \\by Noise in Deep Transformer Models'] Let $\mathbf{v} \in \mathbb{S}^{d-1}$ and $\mathbf{w} \in \mathbb{R}^{d}$. The layer normalization map $\LN(\mathbf{u}) = \frac{\mathbf{u}}{|\mathbf{u}|}$ satisfies the following expansions:
\begin{align*}
    \LN(\mathbf{v}+\mathbf{w}) &= \mathbf{v} + P_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{w} + \mathbf{R}_1, \\
    \LN(\mathbf{v}+\mathbf{w}) &= \mathbf{v} + P_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{w} - \langle \mathbf{v}, \mathbf{w} \rangle P_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{w} - \frac{1}{2}|P_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{w}|^2 \mathbf{v} + \mathbf{R}_2,
\end{align*}
where the remainders are bounded by:
\begin{align*}
     |\mathbf{R}_1| &\le \frac{3 |\mathbf{w}|^2}{\left( \min_{t \in [0,1]} |\mathbf{v} + t\mathbf{w}| \right)^2}, \\
     |\mathbf{R}_2| &\le \frac{6 |\mathbf{w}|^3}{\left( \min_{t \in [0,1]} |\mathbf{v} + t\mathbf{w}| \right)^3}.
\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:02.094111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ddadc733d5760bec235797a40fa8159d9e3f2096258b6d13f7b731ffb8014c1d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2604.26026, 'Stochastic Ordering of Dependent Systems under Transformation Models and Archimedean Copul'] Assume the same conditions as in Theorem~\ref{thm:main1min}. 
