{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:14.890745+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de403e6eec076eac29610230ce9fceaaafaad6f8ca193af944bd69291efa1a9a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2607.11608, '2607.11608'] Let $k\in \N$. Then, we have 
