{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:06:39.297656+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de45706f9c7253d6b4b1a3de13144304063659e8d8c13d354f4c4167ba5a199a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:modified_reflection_equations of arXiv:2607.13748, 'Load Balancing with Individually Heterogeneous Servers'] Consider the set of equations
    \begin{align}
