{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.033613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_deb8fa61f0a3a1ff5dfee7f0647ff885ef0cd83e261a7d1f0d4acf72dc85d692","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6tmod3.1 of arXiv:2609.03926, 'Overcolored Partition $k$-tuples Restricted by Parity of the Parts'] For all $n,r,s,k\ge 0$, we have
