{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.852301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_decc69bde090a656a64107779791e46c4451b18e445eaeeb9ce31f418e8a5c19","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:clt of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] For $\lambda^2$ as in (equation eq:lambda of the paper) and for all  $\hat \beta \in [0,z_a)$, 
