{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.220324+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_decfc621fe4baecab8b80db659582fb3093bf64750aabdf157dba4d453c66334","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:detailed-matrix-overlaps of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] In the setup of Proposition~(prop:sketch-statement-overlap of the paper), let
    \begin{equation}
