{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.580515+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df3d3a85662585ffcf2220cd587f21cd648be0102202b03214b7654a8fa37a6e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq: phi_k Bound of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] For some large enough universal constant $c(\nu_\infty,a_\infty)>0$:
