{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.733615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df6d3c190bb81d9e9bc6446513046ce8b314e93863151e2db9a67f20e8093773","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:51 of arXiv:2508.21658, 'Infinite-dimensional stochastic differential equations for Coulomb random point fields'] For $ \mu $-a.s.\,$ \yy $ and each $ \rR \in \N $, the following hold: 

