{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.355550+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df6e04b78edc3aa596353e8fc21692d85ff62543a259f170b0f253fec9de482c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 34 of arXiv:2606.17501, 'Critical spectral behavior and large deviations for geometric $\alpha$-stable processes'] For $p \in [1, \infty]$, we define the $L^{p}$-spectral radius $\lambda_{p}(\theta\mu)$ as
