{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.750978+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df747f8ad8392c25cde007cf1dcbf8f70ea9f288f0fb1f4f33d946cb3fbe47d4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 125 (Single-shell contraction kernel) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] For every $\eps>0$,
