{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.527099+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df7e5f903a0805404af91d5cf92b0658b749c428ce11cb9d968f36ada1b53e26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:fourier-ball of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] We have 
