{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.586789+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dfd7f6deea01d7cad6d576a984c25e4858d93a326cd9e3cce42a0b7be1638455","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:chi-properties of arXiv:2609.00840, 'Kählerity of complete almost-Kähler gradient shrinking Ricci solitons'] Let $(M^{2m},g,J,\omega,f)$, $m\geq2$, be a complete almost-K\"ahler gradient shrinking Ricci soliton.
