{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.698552+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dfe3b9479001c169685371b9737fb92d0cbd34e2e7f33d84ecd0cc1ac761ecd3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (Score-profile coupling reduction) of arXiv:2607.29560, 'Tractable Relaxations of Multivariate Stochastic Dominance via Optimal Transport and CVaR'] The space $E$ is Polish and
