{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.095232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e02c04eb430a56e5159c6d2538f21e2efbdf3c6552f2231401f8053664cb8d95","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 46 of arXiv:2608.28148, 'Flows and homotopies of Banach Lie algebroids'] Let  $(A,M, \rho,\LB _A)$ be  a Banach  almost Lie algebroid.
