{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.658865+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e03a66d166846934377fee7901c8f4214dbabba06120cb74d288272b04902253","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma a22 of arXiv:2411.19926, 'Sparse Pseudospectral Shattering'] Suppose $\frac{1}{n} < \rho \le 1$, $0 < s < \frac{2}{e}$, $\varepsilon > 0$, and integer $K \ge 1$. Let
