{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.971768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e04403610dfd12bc840e1c2907f77a21cbd3bc92943acc69edbc107773b9687b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 42 of arXiv:2606.13459, 'Symmetric Cooperative Motion in Higher Dimensions'] For an interval $I \subset \R$, let $w,z \in L^{1}(\R^{d} \times I) \cap C(I;L^{1}(\R^{d}))$. Then
