{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.040448+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e062971d94369839237f9059ce4b09bc340004371e8eaecee1e4db8dc02fd906","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] Assume that (S1)--(S3) and (H5) hold. Define
