{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:31.979172+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0c641b51bd251a98544bf59ba440aec223a7c3da7506d68112279cc0d4450c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2606.11389, 'Instability of a nonlinear oscillator with small friction and small additive noise'] {\rm \cite[Lemma 11]{BG02}}
 Let $f$ be a smooth
