{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.795311+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0eaeb7b6e56e8418e183bf9f4eadfea22e134ca81fe48fc948805947f600d67","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p.LowerBoundI of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] For $\gamma \in (0, 2\sqrt{2})$, we have that, almost surely,
    \begin{equation*}
        \min\left \{3-\frac{\gamma^2}{4}, 4-\frac{\gamma^2}{2}\right \} \leq \dim_H(T^{\gamma}).
