\end{equation}
where the set of vectors $\{\boldsymbol{e}_0,\boldsymbol{e}_1,\ldots,\boldsymbol{e}_d\}$ is just the standard orthonormal basis of $\mathbb{R}^{d+1}.$","status":"unverified"}

