{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.127920+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e121ed341f7e6311a6934b2cd26742343f904f763da218556fced57ef975ab4d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 ({\cite[\S 3.2) of arXiv:2608.27450, 'Koszul duality and Morita categories'] {blansblom2025chainrulegoodwilliecalculus}}]
