{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.029671+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e12716cf57f5dc761a48d581789e1f79437560d311dd4a991923a438a3ed3678","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Total variation bound) of arXiv:2605.02713, '2605.02713'] For any $q \in \N$, there exists a positive constant $C(q)$ such that the following bounds are satisfied.
