{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:43.950539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e143bc5cfbe6862a4a01c3db7e64c87c5c64839e0f87f19fcb06cd9261c5bbb6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2412.04527, 'Critical Drift for Brownian Bees and a Reflected Brownian Motion Invariance Principle'] \textit{(Theorem 7.6 in [barakErdos])} Let $Z^N$ be an $N$-BRW and let $M\sim \mathcal{M}$ satisfy:
\begin{itemize}
