{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.610644+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e15c203bde78576a711f58a04d2d428c8f1b25590eaf88bac083fb6ad5932ebe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Let $\beta>0$ be fixed. Then there is a constant $c_\beta>0$ so that 
