{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.019788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1a9ce409819d8cc98fde72535c8159bc05ac7c7568f8efdef49f398f4c27a82","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm continuous-LqlogL-sparse of arXiv:2609.03751, 'Sparse bounds for maximal rough singular integrals'] Let \(1<q<\infty\), let
