{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.615313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1b50ccd2bb061f5ab7c75f0020a6f4486bdf52c339e532ab399395f70ae3c92","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem LR classification of arXiv:2609.01791, 'Minimum $b_2$ of symplectic fillings of lens spaces'] Let $S$ be a left-right sequence. Then, $apply(S)$ covers at least one of the following:
