{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.987814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1b520a0a57fc6f0742aa8a0cb756f21bfc1ec084c52f20ccf5f1ba310f83ac1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:4.3 of arXiv:2608.27474, 'Nonlocality of Cover-Time Changes Under Edge Addition'] Let \(\mathcal R_s\) be the set of distinct positive values of
\(\rho_S\) with nonzero grouped coefficient. Define
