{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.866199+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2ae7963e355f407d42b50e3fe40ccced7d2f16d329ddceea07e0b43affc5d6a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:secondmomentofy1 of arXiv:2509.21253, '\bf Capacity in high dimensional percolation'] For any positive constant $c$, there exists $C>0$, such that for all $L\ge 10K$, $M\ge cL^2$, and $r\ge 2L$, we have 
