{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.661468+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2e411dbc7be951273f17d4a8a5760c47503402a7ecbe4fdb1535eefc9479b55","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 8 of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] For $A\in\mathcal H_E$, define the multiplication-by-$t$ map
