{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.590674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2ff42374423bc1058627da7daf84c2f5714af5ce21026e878ac165ad6922f7c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:Holder of arXiv:2606.02003, 'Higher-Order Multifractional Stable Motion:\\ Definition and Fundamental Properties'] Let $X^{(n)}_H$ be an $n$-MFSM satisfying Assumption~(ass:params of the paper)
