{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.853056+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e35a825917a10252d9151dce798a1ae94ff7884cdb6a140cde947137498875e2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:WishartConcentration of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] Let $W$ be an $m \times m$ Wishart matrix of rank $r \leq m$. For $r \ll m$ holds
