{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.758504+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e37c2e52c2a752bba0e7ecdc8b9c3a59a57c99d41d5c350c0891baa68e0b21bb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:tech:1 of arXiv:2411.02459, 'Existence and higher regularity of statistically steady states for the stochastic Coleman-'] { Given $c,c'>0$, the following holds
\begin{equation*}
