{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.993852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e47528925719dbd7b3f4e257d66de357511a503b552d54bcdc832165d5b3af34","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 38 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] There exists a constant $C_{27}>0$, which depends on the following values:

