{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.581466+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e47a049816169ec2b74e3b0b38186ff544647a18072106c87ed4f31a3faaa858","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:overlap of arXiv:2602.12595, '\textbf{Michel Talagrand and the Rigorous Theory of Mean Field Spin Glasses}'] For independent replicas \(\sigma^1,\sigma^2\sim G_N\),
