{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.043104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e48a323bfab5a7ecc9972819aacf4207a8054a3692146143495a77e875d1fb7d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 67 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Under Assumption \ref{assumption 8.24.1}
