 \left(\prod_{i=0}^{k-1}\{r-i\}\{r+n+i\}\right)
 H_k^{(n)}(K;q),
\end{equation}
with unique Laurent-polynomial coefficients.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.847082+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e494268d9041ef7f196e3ed67a86dc38706204e461b9d52c3413aaf78ded511a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-aux-result of arXiv:2607.08187, 'Asymptotic behaviours of critical branching random walk in $\mathbb{R}^d$'] For any $\gamma\geq 0$ and $\mathbf{y} \in D_1$,
