{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.249086+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4ca63ced056f0d885fc7bfd87909de0af2a5d8b90940cd9904db708cc7128bf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2604.15191, 'Quantitative Stability of Many-Marginal Schr\"odinger Bridge'] For every $\lambda\in[0, 1]$, we have
