{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.480185+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e551ddc335d4db2f954a8bc00f14eb717b11a98274ece3b0970534d9b80426e5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:corrupted:lipschitz of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] For any
