\end{center}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.436242+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e58cc1544784618e73cd119cfc28abfc61213a68a67407052bb9b2cf62fe8afb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm IDLLN of arXiv:2508.07099, 'The Maki-Thompson model with random awareness'] Suppose that $X^n(0)\to X(0)\in E$ almost surely as $n\to\infty$ and define
