{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.081997+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e5c3d3fb808c9b6ad18cd961f4a77b4f68501361780b97fac2f2f20a011a8d09","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma2.5 of arXiv:2609.02607, 'Spatial inhomogeneity for a three-dimensional doubly degenerate nutrient system with indir'] For all $T>0$, there exists $C(T)>0$ such that

