In particular, for the unadorned solution $u:=u^{|\cdot|,\gamma}$,
\begin{equation}
 \mathsf D(t,x)=u_{xxx}(t,x)\leq0,
 \qquad \forall (t,x)\in[0,1)\times(0,\infty).

