{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.187836+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e65ec079d20c038b0c08028ab003f7a3de390e07425a5506790551be9236a344","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2606.30411, 'Notes on constants for maxima of Rademacher averages'] One has
