{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:32:58.356501+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6ac82e40e36143a4de24c822238817000f9da30a8902bf624a0eb7afae31040","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sigmaBd of arXiv:2506.06559, 'Bi-infinite incipient cluster in high dimensions'] Assume that (equation eq:tauAsy of the paper) and (equation eq:Aass of the paper) are valid and $d>6$, then 

