{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.712850+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6b88008d6da21012a09f1e68c8142a53791e9c5991469820d2f14c411b02af2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.06392, '2608.06392'] Suppose that the inter-arrival distribution $F$ admits the representation {\eqref{AISR1.2}} corresponding
