{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.899990+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6da90843d81eed01783ae9301d97bf2c554a30370fdcf3e05ca8d2b28c4c46c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2609.00867, '2609.00867'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:kernel-density}, fix \(\beta>0\).  There exists
