{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.102295+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e713bff41f380089052da4ce0bc89e6397c97f2e161ce09d6ff5ee45c48ee502","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 32 of arXiv:2609.03821, 'Condensation and Metastability in the Supercritical Two-Species Zero-Range Process via Res'] For each $x\in S_{\star}$,
