	\end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.861749+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7163540455c8733e9754f3e9fb43a0cb2d9c213a77e2e129e68a59672cd1467","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2506.10817, 'On the Weak Error for Local Stochastic Volatility Models'] Recall $\hE_\delta$ from Equation \eqref{eq_hatEdelta}. Under Assumptions \ref{Ass:Half_Step} and \ref{Aspt_new}, for any $M>0$ and $p\ge 1$ it holds that 
