{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.411834+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e763ea788a1db78ac65d22fcc15f3776e9a6f2cd645e9570169284839ecaef70","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:uniform_linearized_martingale of arXiv:2608.27313, 'A Finite Sample Analysis for Quantile Temporal Difference Learning in Distributional Reinf'] Let $n$ be an $({\mathcal{F}}_t)$-stopping time with $u\le n\le v$, and let
