        \mathbf E
        \left[
            e^{-\langle h,\Pi^{(\kappa)}\rangle};
            T^{(\kappa)}\in da
        \right]
        =
        e^{-A^{(\kappa)}(h)}
        f_h^{(\kappa)}(a)\,da .
\end{equation}
Consequently, for every \(a>0\) such that \(f_0^{(\kappa)}(a)>0\),
\begin{equation}
        \mathbf E
