{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.782571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7c2be8710eee6b72d2e4265409d0a4e9711980a568c3d29ac0641e2745b2978","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 36 of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] Assume $f\in\H^{\otimes n}$, and $g = g_1\otimes g_2\in\H^{\otimes m}$
