{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:48:02.403977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7c6ccc39eab5d65bba4d8a6b4b912335a99d1417e7a8a04128d49d27f63a4f0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition new upper bound of arXiv:2608.25889, 'Slope Inequalities for the Geography Problem of Spin Symplectic 4-Manifolds'] If Cram\'er's conjecture is true, then we have 
