{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.620351+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7e136339216fe8692c9522439ca09b15ecf7603dd264a362d4e602fccd49f6b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma phi of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d>2$, $\eta > 0$, and $L \ge L_2$.
