{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.857473+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7ec727954c4d17b48fb1738aa1d7b6fd6fa4f72ae57e4cbb15b8cd2bd9687c2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2608.21063, '\textbf{Non-bijective scaling limits and phase transitions of planar maps}'] Set $ g_{\cV} = \left(\frac{64}{9375}\right)^{1/3}$. We have
	\begin{align*}
		\Pr{\ed(\cS(\mV_n))=\ell} = \frac{1}{g_\cV n^{2/3}} \left(  h\left(\frac{4n/5-\ell}{g_\cV n^{2/3}}  \right) + o(1) \right)
