{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.586061+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e8854b7b70fd0ead3614961d9b1415adf924a861142a56500ee7db6d331b8eae","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:algebra of arXiv:2609.00840, 'Kählerity of complete almost-Kähler gradient shrinking Ricci solitons'] Let $E$ be the trace-free Ricci tensor and $E^{\mathrm{inv}}$ its $J$-invariant part:
