{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.820059+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e888e218d3853149748ebd1cb416e751909f961bb22dfe116282345f1ef43fd6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition kernel for frac Laplacian of arXiv:2411.09614, 'Moment estimates for the stochastic heat equation on Cartan-Hadamard manifolds'] Suppose $M$ is a Cartan-Hadamard manifold satisfying $\sec_M\leq-K_1<0$. 
