{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.817345+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e8c51d96855a3f1d887ebe236502db4ca29833399e0d827a1fbe67aea5295aa4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l.leftescape of arXiv:2510.07682, 'From tug-of-war to Brownian Boost: \\ explicit ODE solutions for player-funded stochastic-'] Let $(S_-,S_+) \in \mathcal{N}_{\kappa,\rho}$ with $S_- \in \mathcal{S}_0$.
