{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:46:12.281935+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e96e1481d99ba4ce344b66ab5944e8f898138436a42bcfffaf08bfe000e31c9e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2604.22567, 'Sign-balance of random Laplace eigenfunctions'] For every $\ell\ge 1$ and $\eta\in [1,\ell]$ one has 
