{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:28.003486+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e96fb2cb42b546d50df4718c2b466a02881219bcf3141d3f2aac1b60de820803","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 31 (Uniform defective LSI) of arXiv:2608.24863, 'Uniform Logarithmic Sobolev Inequalities for the 2D Coulomb Gas at the Diffusive Temperatu'] For every fixed $\beta>0$, every $N\ge2$, and every real-valued $f\in \mathsf D_{N,\beta}$,
