{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.012877+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9919ebb5f0121bb7f5ca159b61109a17bbc110647421fd6c0feee2d01116aec","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2605.04359, 'Well-posedness of reflected BSDEs with default time and irregular barrier: An application '] Let $Y \in \mathcal{S}^2_{\beta}$ be a strong $\mathcal{E}^f$-supermartingale on $[\sigma,\eta]$ with $\sigma,\eta \in \mathcal{T}_{[0,T]}$ such that $\sigma \leq \eta$ a.s. The following two properties are equivalent:
