	\end{itemize}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.522885+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9930eb230c6c5185f410f8083d5853da916d7d7c5182f4b12b5090dda83f828","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm POC of arXiv:2411.03104, '{\bf Coupling Methods and Applications on Path Dependent McKean-Vlasov SDEs}\footnote{Supp'] Assume {\bf (C)} with (equation lia of the paper) in place of (equation lip1a of the paper). Let $\mu_0^N\in\mathscr P_{1}((\mathscr C_\infty)^N)$ be exchangeable,  $\mu_0\in \mathscr P_{2}(\mathscr C_\infty)$. Assume that
