{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:25:55.352822+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9c64fcc715b5d40943f9b6a15abcc4df0461e81cfbd42d1b4326456440a248c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 8 of arXiv:2607.27932, '2607.27932'] Define, for $\rho>0$,
