{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.580590+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea1b8da714a4635b387589da32499b8fad9a44e4a7a9506c65ba81bf052e27e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 48 of arXiv:2608.27372, 'Universality and sharp thresholds for ellipsoid fitting'] Fix $\kappa>1$. As
