    \end{equation*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:21:28.776466+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea26caa85a78a2d9b223c255ef948084a3730d0826924c3867950091f2767961","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:gamma-square-ibp-B of arXiv:2605.03718, 'Potential Hessian Ascent III:\\ Sampling the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick Model at $\beta < 1/'] For $t\in(0,1)$,
\begin{equation}

