{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:23:37.874065+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea27c783eb555e53b366b581c4426844c90229187dc0f6def005942a0b305018","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2609.03647, 'Extension Problems for the Vladimirov--Taibleson Operator and the Hierarchical Laplacian'] Suppose that
    \begin{align*}
