{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:12:08.990387+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea2d586236be4268f64cb9822311cc1b3a93a2cf5c531b5f64019f1e16e20380","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_riemannPersistenceLowerBound of arXiv:2608.17463, 'Persistence probabilities of fractional L\'evy fields indexed by hyperbolic space and othe'] The persistence probability of a fractional L\'evy field $(X_H(\eta))_{\eta\in K}$ on the relatively compact set $K$ of a connected $d$-dimensional Riemannian manifold $\mathcal{M}$, where $O$ is in the interior of $K$, satisfies
