{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.286505+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea5c97b72e54d7d8cb2316a4556285b6dd23b802ba22e80ab4679d59ef48d379","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn DefNormalisedChar of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] For $\beta,\delta>0$, $N \in \mathbb{N}$, define the random polynomial $\mathfrak{q}^{\beta,\delta}_N$ by
