{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.821591+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea8c57cac7f724e655779dca7753d1c90b96b8ac559823a97c2f8d54bc805ed5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 (Aldous--Pitman representation) of arXiv:2607.16833, 'Dynamical Equations for Poisson Galton--Watson Trees and Component Densities of Sparse Inh'] Let $U$ be uniform on $(0,1)$ and independent of
