{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.580618+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eaed2bf797622aca9c9bd6a81d4820d6019768a28b55fc3e64d08bca005371e9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-Q1 n m of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $\delta_1=\delta_{\mathcal Q_1}$  be as defined in (equation delta-Qi of the paper) and let $m,n\ge1$.  The following estimates hold true:
