{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:02.089478+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb07ddfd1cd8a3bba454ac23c066c0c1866564f7bcd482eac6efbd453eb4f7cf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 (Threshold phenomenon) of arXiv:2604.25877, 'Asymptotic height of Plancherel random trees'] Let $h=h(n)\ge0$ and $r_n=(n-1)/(n-1+\theta)$.
