{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.857657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb0827d0e1879e0530ae180b52d8b92ecd403612df82b36164b5a5f337244a27","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2607.16479, 'The Site Frequency Spectrum in an Exponentially-Growing Population with Selection'] Define:
