{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.132036+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb42ebd1202607d4e70c9ed0e14b7170c6ac029825bb42f9efecaa247c75155b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Large-penalty expansion) of arXiv:2608.26693, '2608.26693'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:spectral-bounds}, for equal penalties $\tau$, the covariance action satisfies, uniformly over $p$ and all admissible covariance pairs as $\tau\to\infty$,
