{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.242088+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb8b37d24b0f74366fa2b7d0505ffb0ec5a0bc93e75136851994fa2b7050e4b7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 17 of arXiv:2603.05174, 'Regularization of the superposition principle: Potential theory meets Fokker-Planck equati'] Let $V\in p\mathcal{B}([0,\infty)\times \mathbb{R}^d)$ and $\delta_V\in(0,\infty)$ such that
