{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:04.859963+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eba56f1869bade68328a322932254e007326f010a2877e92d71db948e95852b7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prp 19 of arXiv:2511.21496, 'Optimal local central limit theorems on Wiener chaos'] For every $a \in \R$ and $k \in \N_0$, we have $\sD^{k}\delta_a \in \cS_{-1-k}$ and
