{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.300950+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebcd58299d510618cc6a04e9d371f605daac42f3a44b1e70beadef10061f8722","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2606.23433, 'Emergence of Common Noise: Quantitative Conditional Propagation of Chaos'] Let $X=(X^{1},\ldots ,X^{N})$ and $\bar{X}=(\bar{X}
