{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.834486+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebd8e3334ec55a28af5d00cdbf6fc2c26ccbeeb9f95bf67d43b9d858c8f6537e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2609.03830, 'Parabolic Poincar\'e inequalities and maximal function estimates for systems of partial di'] Let $1< p<\infty$, $\max\{1,p-1\}\le q<\infty$ and $\la>0$. 
