{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.457483+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebda2d89547a99baeb750483378067b6516a1b2869962ebcaa35f80a989a1577","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 28 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] [\textbf{One-block estimate}] 
