{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.363606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec94d3de8a15bbdd1192386dfeb255dde5e8d5e83e77cf44df6b7f554c06cc53","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma tool: H reg decay of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] Let $\alpha \in \mathbb R$ and $\beta\geq0$, then
