{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.792978+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec957823f91a3a70f73be327ef3aebcf6516398f32801c270aa5ee6cd4997034","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] The GFF is the centered Gaussian process $(\langle \Gamma,f\rangle)_{f\in C_0^{\infty}(D)}$ whose covariance structure is as follows
