{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.413930+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ed697946cd03547af090ad4ac4df260dfff3e6aa57f853f10f7124cc285e9607","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2606.08115, '2606.08115'] Assume that a two-dimensional random walk $\left\{ \ov{S}_n\right\}$ satisfies condition (C). Let also the correlation coefficient of components of the random walk increments $\rho$ belongs to the interval $(0, 1)$.
