Here the cumulative energy and enstrophy $\mathcal{E}_{\leq K}(\Omega)$, $\mathcal{Z}_{\leq K}(\Omega)$ are defined as in \emph{(\ref{Eq:FluxZeitlin:CumulativeLowFreqEnergyEnstropy})}. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

