{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.341283+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee57989cf508951ecdfb0a4bf01d4535963633dea222a1b87a49b703a9ad7399","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem sec1-thm.2 of arXiv:2602.04303, '\Large\textbf{Strong solutions to SDEs with singular drifts driven by fractional Brownian '] Let $X_{s,t}^x$ be a unique strong solution to the SDE
			\begin{equation}
