					where the constant $S(\varphi)$ is such that $S(\varphi) < C \Lambda_{\Phi}$ and $\Lambda_{\Phi}$ is given in (equation Lips1 of the paper).
					\item[(ii)] for any $\bold{x} \in \mathbb{D}^d$, it holds that 
