{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.713141+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eebab07259855a39630dd2beab37822a51eee8300804c86ff6058a83bc8b16b4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2608.06392, '2608.06392'] Suppose that the inter-arrival distribution $F$ admits a density $f$ and the representation \eqref{AISR1.2}
