{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.490552+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eecdb030a087faaa07c567a50c682832b5d56c1784e17ae501cb63888a6b55ef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] The order $\prec$ satisfies the following.
