{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.768991+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef1ff014dd725cdfd46063646a083cf70d3478be1137d9882b2ba64474f73ccd","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:initial-moments of arXiv:2605.02104, '\textbf{Chart-Generated Probability Geometry\\and Kolmogorov Expectations}'] Let $r \geq 1$. The initial Kolmogorov moment of order $r$ associated
