{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.484727+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef96dd850b88ff1cc9f8c582e920873084d06620fe9193410156e29170b8fe42","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:feebee-ber-rewrite of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] The optimal BER value can be written as
