{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.322627+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f040c42714b68be7056f94975a98bc76f76e2aa092866654e5fef2d678f7047d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 (Endpoint estimate in a mixed strip) of arXiv:2608.30304, '2608.30304'] Let $n\ge1$, $\alpha\ge A_0$ and $-\tfrac12\le\beta\le A_0$. If
