{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.305891+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f05b12e692d1b435395bacb039a4d4754ee2c9519fc35ee20b0a94b700cd54f6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:main of arXiv:2411.14818, 'Scaling limits of solitons in the Box-Ball system'] \mbox{}
