{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.133596+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f11f78ed52f1d8a1fb92b2e9914a89c78cf052f8aa215d9b4892e2eb8c9fabbe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem SymAd of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] One has 
