		\mathbb{P}\big\{\big\vert f(\xi_{1},\cdots, \xi_{n})-\mathbb{E}f(\xi_{1}, \cdots, \xi_{n}) \big\vert>Kt  \big\}\le 4e^{-t^{2}/4}.\nonumber
