{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.334523+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1940738ae253f02a7cf836c5cbc4b6b703bc43542f079c0ac5c3a7521bee962","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 (Stationary Non Uniform Exapnsions) of arXiv:2511.06414, 'Non-uniform Edgeworth expansions for weakly dependent random variables and their applicati'] We say that $W_n$ obeys the \textit{stationary} Edgeworth expansion of order $r$ with power $s\geq 0$ if for every $x\in\bbR$,
