{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.362559+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1c99e1ba942a27eac131fe003d8c930d4d862be8b2a88bf45a2c8a5b905355d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:block-equi of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] Let $I \subseteq (0,1)$ be an interval. For almost every $s$, along
