{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.754491+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f203c3b9c3f39544520d95fa3872a964e99519ff46b02ea563e624beb0efc3f1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm2 of arXiv:2609.02136, 'Gamma approximation and Poisson--Gaussian invariance principle on Poisson chaos'] Fix an integer $q\geq1$ and $\nu\in(0,\infty)$.  Let
$F_n\in\mathcal{C}_q^\eta\cap L^4(\Omega)$ satisfy
