{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.746823+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f241ec9050f82b68b733797fcceca55ea5757c03dd4ff9a1e01104949d3c3d7e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Gaussian fluctuations, rank-one case) of arXiv:2607.08696, 'Spectrum of Directed Inhomogeneous Random Graphs'] Consider the Chung--Lu model with $p_{xy}$ as in Eq.\ \eqref{eq:sp-chung-lu}.
