{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.663436+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f29aeec0b25fe8c8b6ae4739be41eeaa31857ca51293ba8e2dc65cf36efcea7e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:root of arXiv:2609.00889, 'Dominant-Degree Conditions for Ramsey--Tur\'an Factors of Non-Directed Cycle Orientations'] For $D(z,Q,R)$, the following hold.
