    & \quad- \langle b(s, \cdot), \nabla \Phi(s, \cdot) \rangle_H - \frac{1}{2} \Tr \big( \sigma(s, \cdot) \sigma^*(s, \cdot) \nabla^2 \Phi(s, \cdot) \big) + \frac{1}{\varepsilon} \Phi(s, \cdot) \Big](x) \, \mathrm{d}s.
