{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:02:11.267444+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3bbad53440aa987475b40cc992ee5d4830ed534652b2b45f22eee62337437a3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:mass-speed of arXiv:2509.08430, 'One-dimensional particle clouds with elastic collisions'] For the process $G$ as defined at~(equation eq:centre-of-mass of the paper), it holds that
