{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:06.985384+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4335a9b5f34d390c0c454a25425080ebfcf38916e7ac7f611baa4f1eb58de8f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:GM_crystallization of arXiv:2607.27810, 'Perturbed Beta Corners Process'] Let $\{x_i^k(\beta)\}_{1\le i\le k\le N}$ be the unperturbed $\beta$-corners
