{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.918520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4ae8826207d9dc7d4c4aa7e308fa80fcf76ab643721681cca0c2aa7adc635ed","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2607.17177, '2607.17177'] There exists a constant $C>0$, such that for any
