{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:49.835440+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4e84cd66fb179fea7c98cc3a0e7e1da2abe664836b1997aaf3e81dfba74c10f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 of arXiv:2506.12834, 'Space-time fractional stochastic partial differential equations driven by L\'evy white noi'] Let $p>0$ if $\alpha\ge d$ or $0<p<\frac{d}{d-\alpha}$ if $\alpha<d$. Then,
