{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.249281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4fcb21d9b2749dc22bc16e7cb7f1d822ddf0d8d94cc0767d56bbe3b3eafc4fa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 29 (Theorem 1.6 of \citep{conforti2021formula}) of arXiv:2604.15191, 'Quantitative Stability of Many-Marginal Schr\"odinger Bridge'] We have for any $t$, $\varepsilon >0$,
