{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.238760+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f53d4c3bf08c08868e2b66ceca573d675216729d613b020762843f989a8f0e8b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:lutz-lutz-point-to-set of arXiv:2608.29561, 'Ball codes: A coding characterization of Hausdorff and packing dimensions'] For every nonempty set \(E\subseteq\mathbb R^n\),
