{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:49.211469+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f55faff3f3ca89a981ddf436cb6d00e1ea210a3d4a51272bd1f1f2e129f5cc0b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2604.27519, 'Quantitative homogenization of the maximal action of curves in a Brownian potential'] For any pair of dyadic scales $1\le l'< l\le L$ we have

