\item and the proportion of the good mass $\gamma_t / (1+t)$ tends to $1$ and the marked GHP distance between the rescaled entire tree $\frac{1}{\sqrt{1+t}} \cdot \boldsymbol{\mathcal{T}}_t^{\, \bullet}$ and the good part $\frac{1}{\sqrt{\gamma_t}} \cdot \boldsymbol{\mathcal{G}}_t^{\, \bullet}$ tends to $0$. 
