{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.740902+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f584ef596511ef83eb0254312b94bfdc22483e38ea7c4e045ef77f692c545d5d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2506.10494, 'Geometric Jensen-Shannon Divergence Between Gaussian Measures On Hilbert Space'] Let $A \in \Tr(\Hcal)$. Let $\{e_k\}_{k \in \Nbb}$ be any
