{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.769129+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5a857eb0591de231fdaba9b6fd129566263f83129d3d6c1c36accdefee3b357","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:centred-moments of arXiv:2605.02104, '\textbf{Chart-Generated Probability Geometry\\and Kolmogorov Expectations}'] Let $r \geq 1$ and let $\bar u = \mathbb{E}(G(X))$. The centred Kolmogorov moment
of order $r$ associated with $G$ is defined by
\begin{equation}
