{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:32:56.075378+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f614fa96a2bdb894f7d8cf0f987093f8e51523fc75349ab15715e039f6c715ca","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:modulus-space-U of arXiv:2411.12192, 'Sample path properties and small ball probabilities for stochastic fractional diffusion eq'] Assume the conditions of Lemma (le:sLND-hat-U of the paper) hold and recall that $\theta_2$ is given in (equation e:theta12 of the paper). For any
