{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.193500+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f64481ac36e0507051f624fd87a1514e00dd5f83e9533f5614d069a968a1179b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2606.31455, 'Discrete time-multidimensional renewal theory and applications'] Assume the conditions of Theorem~\ref{thm:clt-additive} and that $m\stackrel{\lambda}{\to}\infty$
