is well-defined and finite. We continue to denote the value by $\cE(u,\psi)$. For a relatively compact open set $D_2$ with $\overline{D_1} \subset D_2 \subset \overline{D_2} \subset D$ and $\phi \in C_0(D)\cap \cF$ with $\phi=1$ on $\overline{D_2}$, it also holds that
