{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.812412+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7202773b06013a0279194f2d3d4cf53cc1a9ccaf0ac594be9e1d79cb9724b2b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
