{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:25:40.367247+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7549c5389b9064054987fbb2e1c3f63b0b47fb9f17b52a01b9c5a57ac5b3a95","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:quasi_isometry of arXiv:2503.21737, 'High-intensity Voronoi percolation on manifolds'] For every $\varepsilon>0$ and every distinct vertices $x,y\in V_\varepsilon$,
    \begin{equation}
