=-2\pi i \delta_{a,0}\delta_{b,0}\delta_{c,0}, \\
\lim_{\epsilon\to 0}\int_{|z|=\epsilon} z^a \bar z^b |z|^c \frac{d|z|}{|z|} 
&=0.
} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

