{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.944830+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7824743f90b14f21e61c5ec18795cee5b8704e614f00098d7c27ed2f7d12753","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Coro of arXiv:2412.05746, 'Hyperbolicity, slimness, and minsize, on average'] For a geodesic space or a graph $X$,
    \begin{enumerate}
