{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.830450+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f78e0e5bd9bf4943d83eaf674a2bfaf44c405e93b614a112aba8c62c5132c248","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:HS-curvature-full of arXiv:2609.00556, 'Higgs--Demailly System and Positivity of Higgs Bundles'] On a Riemann surface the Hitchin--Simpson curvature is of type $(1,1)$ and is
