{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.758284+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7a9a38051f787d27f32969c87e52192ef8a2a21a4cbf2446f7b31dc593d1626","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2511.05386, 'CLT for $\beta$-ensembles with Freud weights, application to the KLS conjecture in Schatte'] Let $p>2$. 
