{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:55:37.823866+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7c2dcea29be51fbfb85c6a01ab5540f1ac6677021d725f54ee7239c7f315c81","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem noexcursion of arXiv:2605.06488, 'Continuous-state branching processes with L\'evy-Khintchine drift-interaction: Laplace dua'] Let $n$ be a $\sigma$-finite positive measure on $\mathcal{E}_\infty$ such that  \begin{equation} 
