{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.612433+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7c70a551105819ac0d2c431b8caa862b15bfdb19f490c517f4a42f156e4f37f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Assume $a_n\ge 10/\beta+8$ and $2a_n/n\le \eps_n\le 1$. Then we have
