{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.356967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7cd245f0edfe18bfad54cd22d037c9691bfc0d2bd0720d205127e4b9d839ed6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:static-dynamic-embedding of arXiv:2608.23860, 'Revelation Control'] For every nested pair $\mathscr F_h\subseteq\mathscr F_{h'}$,
