{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.352686+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7d1aeedac136cc777b5da1be8f7cb8f1c2e18a664fcc3bd64d2cae383b8ca86","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] Let $S$ denote $I \cap \cE$, where $I$ is a uniformly random independent set conditioned on the event $I \cap \cE \in \Sep^\cE$.
