		\mathrm{Var} \left( \Delta X_k | \mathcal{F}_k \right) &= Z_k + O \left( Z_k^2 \right) + O \left( \frac{X_k}{V_k} \right) + O \left( \frac{\log^2 n}{V_k} \right), 
