{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:00:15.223757+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f86397ac8043f83a4a695e935a3817f47862caab42fd7286fbc6341ca16e9f0c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 54 of arXiv:2607.18201, 'Finding Adam in noisy trees'] For any $\delta>0$ we have
