{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:43.891808+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f88c3f63ee8d0c76ef3f06b14f1cc2a986087a9a77847e525309ef03245265eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Vlproof of arXiv:2412.04396, 'Superdiffusive Scaling Limits for the Symmetric\\ Exclusion Process with Slow Bonds'] Assume that $n\ll \ell \ll nk$. Then there exists a constant $C(\varepsilon_0)$ such that
