{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:55:27.258512+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8ba221dab8582283381ee46243dacd207307dc3ab005cd00f1d507abe86c27e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:5 of arXiv:2410.23250, 'Strict inequalities for arm exponents in planar percolation'] There exists an absolute constant $c_1>0$ such that
