{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.481066+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8be21a965c5886e5e554e7e942c484ff96fcf76b3e5ecbae46be883eb5fd85b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sandwich of arXiv:2606.22636, 'Spectral Gap for the Binary Fixed-Margin Swap Chain'] Let \(u,v\) be positive log-concave weights on \(\mathbb Z_{\ge0}\), and define
		\[
