{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.778078+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8fd1dbb9be227589d4dff038533372e62bb801818bce98ff87b9eb541200d68","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary coro::two_point_FK of arXiv:2411.01467, 'Conformal covariance of connection probabilities \\ in the 2D critical FK-Ising model'] Let $y_1^a, y_2^a\in a\mathbb{Z}^2$ satisfy $\lim_{a\to 0}y_1^a=0$ and $\lim_{a\to 0}y_2^a=1$. Then we have
