{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.518020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9163ead90cb1c70fea9324386be4ecd0e5b9e0c06835277c4742f0f8278dc35","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma spicy of arXiv:2411.07609, 'Activated Random Walks on $\bZ$ with Critical Particle Density'] There exist positive constants $C$ and $c$ such that
