Then conditionally given $\ccG$, the laws of the processes $(Z^{_{(n)}}_{^{\,}}\! )_{n\in \bbN^*}$ are a.s.~tight on $\bC^{0} (\bbR_+, \bbR)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

