{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.899356+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f95905c27224d4bc26516ba92c99e5eb2361343c98ff0ee5a538cbd2cac74deb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Qtrans of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] The transition probabilities of the queuing process $Q_n$ (equation queue of the paper) can be expressed by orthogonal polynomials. Specifically, We have 
