{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.998154+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f974b92e4ec73da3d53fbe373ba660affd2e0376f12059204cc2f80507fddef0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM:SW of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $\xi \in \mathbb{R}$.

