{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.124965+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa0c80e89b3e61a478a259fe633ded001f3dac9697722c237e3ca293fdf7b163","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma th:comb of arXiv:2510.00748, '\bf On irreducible central limit theorems'] If $C \subseteq V_n$ satisfies
