{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.224952+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa28ff606851c469670a99a14789af70bc417b77dc60b1b5041cb73b4c7c6d77","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq: RI cover level of arXiv:2411.16398, 'Large Deviations of Cover Time of Tori in Dimensions $d\geq 3$'] For $\gamma>0$, let $\displaystyle\lim_{N\to\infty}R_N/N^\gamma=1$ and $v_N = u_N(\gamma)(1+\rho_N)$ with \\ $\displaystyle\lim_{N\to\infty}\rho_N\log N=0$. 
