{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:04.866463+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa301c83400962cf2c9936589629d0b0341ccee56686a7bcb5ae39f1782fde60","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2512.00213, 'On strong sharp phase transition in the random connection model'] Let $A_1,A_2\subset \BX$, $A=A_1 \cup A_2$, and $v\in A$. If $A_1\cap A_2\ne\emptyset$, then
