{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:59.372990+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fac663bebf89d756ecf827a81a21831cdd41adaa7cfaaa8da76cc184a3645176","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2609.03961, 'On the exponential sum over squarefree integers'] Let $M\ge1$.  There is a trigonometric polynomial
