{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.415679+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb0dda373f5771b113b88f546395df91b14ae277edfbced0b26138003b0d54f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2608.31099, '\bf On (fake) Stationarity in Stochastic Volterra Equations with Affine Drift and Regular '] Let \(\alpha \in (1, \frac32)\). For every \(k \geq 1\),
