{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.252372+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb26e45696916907a2a71698b322dc611cebae01a41965a19553f87cecb5e382","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 26 of arXiv:2604.15226, '\bfseries Nonlinear Schrödinger equations with spatial white noise potential on full space'] Let $\mu>0$ and $\gamma\in(0,2-\frac{d}{2})$. We have
