{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.634301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb2a4641d6213c02dddf30ae1d080586e243fe14b9b91fcf904b602a9f55c221","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2605.31088, 'On couplings for kinetic Langevin diffusions'] Let $z,\tilde z\in\R^{2d}$ and $n\in\N_{>0}$, and let $E_k$ be given
