    chain.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.523250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb3e55a1e827fafc5a4b6cb057f0aea9ed55929a7ed4044b885ba9ff13e3d3c0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: extreme-cases of arXiv:2601.13426, 'A uniformity principle for spatial matching'] In the dual service range model, 
