{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.938710+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc24fd5852c7c3611accfec15ac958695ca2f1b52b604da5da6df759348b3031","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma corollary_2.9 of arXiv:2412.05709, 'Incipient infinite clusters and volume growth for Gaussian free fields and loop soups on m'] For any $3\le d\le 5$, there exist $C,c>0$ such that the following hold.
