{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.759005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc76a4b5d371553eefb1d40516177321502932ddaac2b6b1088c9753082f259c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] The $\mathbb{F}^{\xi^{\lambda,z}}$-predictable compensator associated with $\sigma_z^{\lambda}$ is
