        A^B_{ij} \overset{a.s.}{=} \mathbf{1}\{U_{ij}\le W_B(U_i,U_j)\}, \qquad i,j \in \nbb.
    \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.022273+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc867b05139521f64fa95f85d96189b803f02a366b9b20510506f02d246bd098","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 7 of arXiv:2608.15379, 'Stochastic Jacobi fields along discontinuous martingales on Riemannian submanifolds'] Define the map $\gamma^{\bcl} \colon TM\times TM \to TTM$ by
