{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.874778+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd6f5d62ce84e57c7454e363cb8bf51463423ba585f57c75ab442fa75ff4acf4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm_mst_max of arXiv:2608.08529, 'Maximum Spanning Trees of Random Geometric Graphs With Independent Edge Weights'] Let~\(\epsilon_1,\epsilon_2\) be as in~((f_eq of the paper)) and suppose~\(nr_n^2p_n \geq M\log{n}\) for
