{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.759233+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fda5adbf7328c2e6450f22c270e1c54938b732a5e610ff6189c0df29722859ce","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 (\textit{A priori} bounds) of arXiv:2511.05386, 'CLT for $\beta$-ensembles with Freud weights, application to the KLS conjecture in Schatte'] Let $p>1$. Let $K \subset \R$ be a compact set.
