{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.320833+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe3dfd8e34abd4b520b3a8f30a9709b5e4d23dd06d8680c189ee349bdbc37a20","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:IntroDK of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] In the setting of Assumptions~(ass:IntroSetting of the paper) and~(ass:QPPIntro of the paper), suppose further that~$\mssW$ is a diffusion with generator~$\mssL$.
