{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.055787+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe4cc3d0b9eebc4c3dcb3e38a4cf1196d3aecd9b695734117327c5898264e16f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2608.15914, 'Absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical syste'] Let \cref{ass:gaussian-stable-selected} hold, i.e. $q_N\to q_0$. There are
