{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.236942+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe555c8950d939591b25687816d2a457baf88a34c7b327a8de0ba95f353e5d84","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma z4.36 of arXiv:2604.22510, 'Asymptotics of Multi-Scale McKean--Vlasov Diffusions with Super-Linear Kernels: a Lifted S'] The control $z:[0,T]\times\mathbb{R}^m\to\mathbb{R}^d$ defined by
	\begin{align*}
