\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.778860+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe5cab9ef3dce2b118fa85e0ca765396857ae13f50976f0b46a49cb96efd85cf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thDVtrap of arXiv:2411.18359, 'Large systems of symmetrized trapped Brownian Bridges and Schr\"odinger processes'] Consider the mapping $I_W:{\mathcal M }_1(\mathbb{R}^d)\to [0,\infty]$,
