{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.902563+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe6fac91d570ce998933355db8f389466af2b45e577bc66a629fec4a55a9a8f0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop eqn:qg of arXiv:2411.11415, 'The ballistic limit of the log-Sobolev constant equals the Polyak--\L{}ojasiewicz constant'] Suppose $h \in C^2(\R^d)$
