\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.796740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe790ec5c33b858e616fa16368de6ef976c6c9222b7936a44fa3f3717e2a883c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 29 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Assume that $(\bu_0,\phi_0) \in\mathbb{H}$.
