{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.311585+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe7afbda2361e08d97a3d00b99349365cf2a0d8b44b5530b4267d09704dcc97f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main result, general of arXiv:2605.31356, 'P\'olya--Schur problems and free probability'] If $\{f_{n}\}$ satisfy Assumption (assump:main assumption of the paper), then weakly as probability measures  \begin{equation}
