{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.321439+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe7cb70408a5590844e493418d404d6731d9a9025b0e73c2277df96322c1f2d4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:SRWconst of arXiv:2601.10624, 'Source localisation in simple random walks'] Let $d \geqslant 5$. For each $\varepsilon \in (0, 1)$, there is a constant $K \coloneqq K(\varepsilon) \in \mathbb{N}$ such that
