{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.057051+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fea367ab7502822c27fcb91c88198f4a8c8496b6628d6f9e220df9770a09b3c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:causal-reweighting of arXiv:2608.16119, 'Fully nonlinear parabolic equations under a fixed reference diffusion: weighted \texorpdfs'] Suppose that Assumption~(ass:reference-diffusion of the paper) holds.
