- L_{x,x+1}(\eta_x \eta_{x+1})\big|  
\le K(\eta_x^2+\eta_{x+1}^2 +1). 
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.263281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_febf7bfa7b26dcc76da61404f83031b6834e97d72711945d598135ec9832adf9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma databound of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Fix {\small$\delta>0$}. If {\small$\kappa$} is large enough, then with high probability, we have (for all {\small$\x\in\Z$}) that

