{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.034181+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff15d786e1887cee578de58eade62a89e85464e16680cd70a7b9ce53eaf3ec6d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 3 of arXiv:2609.00739, '2609.00739'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:main}, a subsequence satisfies
