{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.587170+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff854aee3150fa4ce4a5441be5b167312300976598dfad972ac39b5fe262af76","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop superprop of arXiv:2608.30518, 'Grow-up rates of inhomogeneous semilinear heat equations in the critical dimension'] There exist $\widehat{T}>T_0$ such that
