{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.750028+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fffabfbf6843dd5320aaf7060c268568c1dc90582a9ae031fd0e2479a71b8921","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma CLTSmin of arXiv:2606.09386, 'High-degree vertices in uniform recursive directed acyclic graphs with freezing'] Consider the same notation and conditions as in Proposition~(prop:depthlabelsinglevertex of the paper). Additionally, recall $\mathcal{S}_n^-(a_1)$ from~(equation eq:definition_selection_sets_ungreedy_depth_single_vertex of the paper) and let $\text{Geo}_m\sim \mathrm{Geo}(1/(m+1))$ be independent of $\mathcal{S}_n^-(a_1)$. Fix $y\in \mathbb{R}$ and define the event 
